DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
36392::$$$message_0267_0000_0000$$$::"...Hey, what now, Himuro?"::
36393::$$$message_0267_0001_0000$$$::"I think you know, Makino-G."::
36394::$$$message_0267_0002_0000$$$::A new mystery hangs over us.::
36395::$$$message_0267_0003_0000$$$::...That might be overstating it. The Mitsuzuri-Matou theory was debunked, giving rise to new and entirely different possibilities.::
36396::$$$message_0267_0004_0000$$$::We huddle together before homeroom.[lr]::
36397::$$$message_0267_0004_0001$$$::The topic is...::
36398::$$$message_0267_0005_0000$$$::"Ryudou and Miss Mitsuzuri... They would make a fetching couple."::
36399::$$$message_0267_0006_0000$$$::"Mm-hm, they would look simply picturesque together.[lr]::
36400::$$$message_0267_0006_0001$$$::This is Issei Ryudou we're talking about. No one would look better with her in a painting."::
36401::$$$message_0267_0007_0000$$$::The thought of that sounds very intriguing to me, and Yukika seems to adore it.[lr]::
36402::$$$message_0267_0007_0001$$$::Issei Ryudou, our student council president, has yet to lose the throne of Homurahara's Most Handsome even in his third year.::
36403::$$$message_0267_0008_0000$$$::He has the best grades of the boys, and is even skilled at martial arts, though he tries not to make a show of it.[lr]::
36404::$$$message_0267_0008_0001$$$::Modest and sincere, skilled in pen and sword. He's no less attractive than the refined Shinji Matou, in that sense.[lr]::
36405::$$$message_0267_0008_0002$$$::Issei Ryudou, dating Ayako Mitsuzuri...::
36406::$$$message_0267_0009_0000$$$::But Makidera vehemently denies it's true.[lr]::
36407::$$$message_0267_0009_0001$$$::Makidera grimaces in displeasure at our admiration.::
36408::$$$message_0267_0010_0000$$$::"Picturesque? I guess people will paint anything these days!"::
36409::$$$message_0267_0011_0000$$$::"Isn't that important? When items become art, the public at large comes to approve of them despite their flaws."::
36410::$$$message_0267_0012_0000$$$::"But Maki, don't you think Ryudou and Miss Mitsuzuri would make a lovely couple?"::
36411::$$$message_0267_0013_0000$$$::Yukika was very excited to hear about this potential pairing from Sakura Matou.::
36412::$$$message_0267_0014_0000$$$::I can understand how she feels.[lr]::
36413::$$$message_0267_0014_0001$$$::They really do make a picture-perfect couple.::
36414::$$$message_0267_0015_0000$$$::From an emblazoned black hakama and snow-white wedding kimono, to a jet-black suit and white wedding dress, they'd look good in anything. They're an ideal combination that titillates my imagination.[lr]::
36415::$$$message_0267_0015_0001$$$::There would be nothing bad to say about this couple, at least in my opinion.::
36416::$$$message_0267_0016_0000$$$::"No, but...okay, I admit that's true.[lr]::
36417::$$$message_0267_0016_0001$$$::But can you imagine Issei Ryudou dating Mitsuzuri? I sure can't."::
36418::$$$message_0267_0017_0000$$$::"Hmm? Why do you say that, Maki?"::
36419::$$$message_0267_0018_0000$$$::"It's obvious. President Ryudou hates the athletic clubs and favors the cultural clubs."::
36420::$$$message_0267_0019_0000$$$::"He does. I remember the big fight over club budgets last year."::
36421::$$$message_0267_0020_0000$$$::"This is [font italic=true]Issei Ryudou[font italic=false] we're talking about. No way he'd fall for the captain of the influential kyudo club."::
36422::$$$message_0267_0021_0000$$$::The thought seems to sadden Yukika.[lr]::
36423::$$$message_0267_0021_0001$$$::Makidera's words have merit. There is some truth to them, but that is not all.::
36424::$$$message_0267_0022_0000$$$::"Issei Ryudou is an individual before he is a student council president. Maki, don't you focus on yourself before acting as the captain of the track & field club?"::
36425::$$$message_0267_0023_0000$$$::"Nah, that high and mighty president could definitely put business first. He's the most strait-laced guy there is."::
36426::$$$message_0267_0024_0000$$$::"...That's also true. But in that case..."::
36427::$$$message_0267_0025_0000$$$::I pull up a chair and bring my face closer to Makidera and Yukika.[lr]::
36428::$$$message_0267_0025_0001$$$::Come to think of it, this hypothesis is appealing, too.::
36429::$$$message_0267_0026_0000$$$::"They're Romeo and Juliet."::
36430::$$$message_0267_0027_0000$$$::"...What's that?"::
36431::$$$message_0267_0028_0000$$$::"Ryudou and Miss Mitsuzuri are enemies, but they actually love each other?"::
36432::$$$message_0267_0029_0000$$$::Correct. As expected, she's quicker to understand than Makidera.::
36433::$$$message_0267_0030_0000$$$::"In other words, Makino-G, Issei Ryudou has to oppose the athletic clubs because of his position. As a result, he'd naturally be more conscious of the few female club leaders, including Lady Mitsuzuri."::
36434::$$$message_0267_0031_0000$$$::"Hm, hm."::
36435::$$$message_0267_0032_0000$$$::"But in spite of that, foes can start to see each other as man and woman, allowing love to bloom on the battlefield."::
36436::$$$message_0267_0033_0000$$$::"Furthermore, adversarial relationships can, on occasion, be blighted by tragic love, lighting the fires of romance."::
36437::$$$message_0267_0034_0000$$$::"Ooh," Makidera remarks, impressed.[lr]::
36438::$$$message_0267_0034_0001$$$::If that's the case, then it sounds just like an opera plot. How laughable.::
36439::$$$message_0267_0035_0000$$$::"Makes sense. Like the thrill of an illicit affair between them, right?"::
36440::$$$message_0267_0036_0000$$$::"Indeed. This hypothesis would also explain why their relationship has never been discovered. The temple boy would never admit it."::
36441::$$$message_0267_0037_0000$$$::"Temple boy? Who's that, Kane?"::
36442::$$$message_0267_0038_0000$$$::"...Apologies. I mean Issei Ryudou."::
36443::$$$message_0267_0039_0000$$$::I got so carried away I accidentally used an inappropriate nickname for Ryudou.::
36444::$$$message_0267_0040_0000$$$::Makidera and Yukika seem to understand, somewhat.[lr]::
36445::$$$message_0267_0040_0001$$$::Still, compared to Yukika who looks spellbound, Makidera seems as skeptical as ever.::
36446::$$$message_0267_0041_0000$$$::Of course she'd be. But...::
36447::$$$message_0267_0042_0000$$$::"Hmm...hm... Ryudou, huh... He doesn't get along with Tohsaka, either."::
36448::$$$message_0267_0043_0000$$$::"She's more like his nemesis. The discord between Lady Tohsaka and President Ryudou is well known."::
36449::$$$message_0267_0044_0000$$$::"...I see. Nice."::
36450::$$$message_0267_0045_0000$$$::What is she thinking about?[lr]::
36451::$$$message_0267_0045_0001$$$::Her disgruntled expression vanishes, replaced by a delighted grin.::
36452::$$$message_0267_0046_0000$$$::"All right. Let's get Ryudou and Mitsuzuri together."::
36453::$$$message_0267_0047_0000$$$::"...I'm not sure what you're getting at, Makino-G. We're not trying to be matchmakers. We were just discussing the viability of their relationship."::
36454::$$$message_0267_0048_0000$$$::"It's fiiiine, Himuro. That isn't the important thing here. Hm... Mufufufu. So that's how it is, Mitsuzuri. If we get her with Ryudou, then I won't have to deal with that attitude anymore... Heeheehee."::
36455::$$$message_0267_0049_0000$$$::Makidera is in bizarrely good cheer.[lr]::
36456::$$$message_0267_0049_0001$$$::It's enough to make me wave my hand in front of her face to check if she's still with us.::
36457::$$$message_0267_0050_0000$$$::"What do we do, Kane? Maki's acting weird..."::
36458::$$$message_0267_0051_0000$$$::"It's all right, Yukika. She's still Makino-G at the end of the day."::
36459::$$$message_0267_0052_0000$$$::"[se storage=se197.wav]Gong gong gong![wvl][se storage=se197.wav] You sure know your stuff, Kane! [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服02c(近)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服02c(近) textoff=0]No wonder you're our Zhuge Liang!"::
36460::$$$message_0267_0053_0000$$$::...Apparently, she's ringing an imaginary gong.[lr]::
36461::$$$message_0267_0053_0001$$$::I really would like to know whether she's praising me or just getting carried away with her own delusions.::
36462::$$$message_0267_0054_0000$$$::I press my fingers against my temples to stave off the headache.[lr]::
36463::$$$message_0267_0054_0001$$$::I feel like we're losing sight of our initial objective...::
36464::$$$message_0267_0055_0000$$$::"If Kane is Zhuge Liang, then who does that make me?"::
36465::$$$message_0267_0056_0000$$$::"Hm, it's hard to compare you to a general, Yukicchi. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服02d(近)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服02d(近) textoff=0]Maybe Lu Su... [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服03a(近)][wvl canskip=false time=800][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服03a(近) textoff=0]Never mind that. We need to find a witness as usual, right?"::
36466::$$$message_0267_0057_0000$$$::Beaten to the punch, I simply nod.[lr]::
36467::$$$message_0267_0057_0001$$$::Makidera being Makidera, it seems that she wants to prove that the temple boy is dating Lady Mitsuzuri. I wonder where her newfound enthusiasm is coming from.::
36468::$$$message_0267_0058_0000$$$::"Who should we ask first? I believe Ryudou has a brother."::
36469::$$$message_0267_0059_0000$$$::"Yeah, I've seen him at Ryudou Temple. He's a monk."::
36470::$$$message_0267_0060_0000$$$::...It's too unreasonable to ask a sworn monk about the love life of his layperson little brother. Even more unreasonable than asking Mitsuzuri's little brother.::
36471::$$$message_0267_0061_0000$$$::"The kid's practically made of doom and gloom, right down to his blood vessels."::
36472::$$$message_0267_0062_0000$$$::"Down to the cellular or genetic level, perhaps... [cacheimage storage=氷室制服02d(近)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02d(近) textoff=0]Well then, what should we do? At this point Ryudou's lack of social skills is a curse."::
36473::$$$message_0267_0063_0000$$$::I frown.[lr]::
36474::$$$message_0267_0063_0001$$$::It's well-known that Issei Ryudou keeps a tight social circle.[lr]::
36475::$$$message_0267_0063_0002$$$::People say that he's shy, despite his prominent position.[lr]::
36476::$$$message_0267_0063_0003$$$::I think they say similar things about me too, but let's shelve that topic for now.::
36477::$$$message_0267_0064_0000$$$::"I know, right? You could count the number of friends he has with your fingers... [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01g(近)][wvl canskip=false time=800][chgfg time=200 storage=蒔寺制服01g(近) textoff=0]Ugh."::
36478::$$$message_0267_0065_0000$$$::"It has to be him."::
36479::$$$message_0267_0066_0000$$$::...He's hardly an ideal option, though.::
36480::$$$message_0267_0067_0000$$$::"Who are we talking about, Kane?"::
36481::$$$message_0267_0068_0000$$$::"...Shirou Emiya. That's a problem. He's the object of Lady Tohsaka's affection."::
36482::$$$message_0267_0069_0000$$$::"Ahh... Right..."::
36483::$$$message_0267_0070_0000$$$::The only person who would know both Ayako Mitsuzuri and Issei Ryudou well is that odd boy, Shirou Emiya.[lr]::
36484::$$$message_0267_0070_0001$$$::It's true he's a former kyudo club member, and one of Ryudou's few friends.::
36485::$$$message_0267_0071_0000$$$::Be that as it may, he's also Lady Tohsaka's sweetheart. Would it be wise for us to approach him?::
36486::$$$message_0267_0072_0000$$$::Makidera makes an expression like she just took a sip of mud thinking it was coffee.::
36487::$$$message_0267_0073_0000$$$::"U-ugh. Emiya. Does he have some grudge against me? Always getting in my way..."::
36488::$$$message_0267_0074_0000$$$::"I don't think those are his intentions at all. Oh well. Keep those thoughts to yourself, Maki. Don't put the cart before the horse."::
36489::$$$message_0267_0075_0000$$$::"Emiya...right... Oh, but if he's going out with Miss Tohsaka, he might know a lot about Miss Mitsuzuri."::
36490::$$$message_0267_0076_0000$$$::"Exactly. Just accept it, Makino-G."::
36491::$$$message_0267_0077_0000$$$::"Uuugh... Urrrgh..."::
36492::$$$message_0267_0078_0000$$$::"Excuse me. Is Emiya in?"::
36493::$$$message_0267_0079_0000$$$::"Hm. If it isn't Madam Himuro. We're delighted to be graced by your presence. What business have you with our Emiya?"::
36494::$$$message_0267_0080_0000$$$::"I'm here to cross-examine him."::
36495::$$$message_0267_0081_0000$$$::...This anachronistic way of talking must be Gotou.::
36496::$$$message_0267_0082_0000$$$::"Oh? What an unusual choice of words. Is he under arrest?"::
36497::$$$message_0267_0083_0000$$$::"Why, Shirou Emiya carries himself within the group like a humble ronin who wouldn't hurt a fly. But as I suspected, he's no ordinary man, is he?"::
36498::$$$message_0267_0084_0000$$$::"Ahh, if spinning a chair with a single move means he isn't normal, then that's the moment I knew he wasn't normal. [cacheimage storage=氷室制服02e(中)][wvl canskip=false time=600][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02e(中) textoff=0]I take it, Madam Himuro, you're currently working as a spy, investigating an arson or thievery case."::
36499::$$$message_0267_0085_0000$$$::"It's nothing so impressive. I have nothing to hide, and my conscience is clean."::
36500::$$$message_0267_0086_0000$$$::"Tch. I see.[lr]::
36501::$$$message_0267_0086_0001$$$::Well, to be straight with you, Emiya's on the roof."::
36502::$$$message_0267_0087_0000$$$::"Mm. You have my thanks. [cacheimage storage=氷室制服01a(中)][wvl canskip=false time=800][i2i storage=i学園廊下][fg time=300 pos=rc index=2000 storage=氷室制服01a(中)]You heard him. Let's go to the roof."::
36503::$$$message_0267_0088_0000$$$::My friends stand behind me, dumbfounded.[lr]::
36504::$$$message_0267_0088_0001$$$::...That was a rather eccentric conversation, but I don't think it was [font italic=true]that[font italic=false] surprising.::
36505::$$$message_0267_0089_0000$$$::"What's wrong, Maki? Lunch will be over if you keep spacing out like that."::
36506::$$$message_0267_0090_0000$$$::"...What the heck were you guys talking about?"::
36507::$$$message_0267_0091_0000$$$::"Wow, Kane. You're like a medieval policeman."::
36508::$$$message_0267_0092_0000$$$::...Yukika ended up complimenting me. I think she should be praising Gotou's performance, instead.::
36509::$$$message_0267_0093_0000$$$::"...Well, whatever. Let's go make Emiya spill the beans."::
36510::$$$message_0267_0094_0000$$$::"I'm skeptical about whether you even remember half of what we talked about this morning."::
36511::$$$message_0267_0095_0000$$$::"Huh? We're going to get Mitsuzuri and Ryudou together, right? And we'll convince Emiya to help us..."::
36512::$$$message_0267_0096_0000$$$::...How did she manage to twist it into serving her own agenda? Our morning topic must have fermented inside Makidera during fourth period and come out as a completely different organism.::
36513::$$$message_0267_0097_0000$$$::"No, Maki. We're going to ask Emiya if Miss Mitsuzuri and Ryudou are dating."::
36514::$$$message_0267_0098_0000$$$::"Was that it?[lr]::
36515::$$$message_0267_0098_0001$$$::Well, either works for me. We'll make Emiya spill it."::
36516::$$$message_0267_0099_0000$$$::We head for the roof.[lr]::
36517::$$$message_0267_0099_0001$$$::There won't be enough time to eat lunch unless we take care of this quickly.[lr]::
36518::$$$message_0267_0099_0002$$$::...Still, I mutter something to Makidera on the way up.::
36519::$$$message_0267_0100_0000$$$::"...Why are you so obsessed with Mitsuzuri and Ryudou dating?"::
36520::$$$message_0267_0101_0000$$$::"Huh? I thought you wanted that."::
36521::$$$message_0267_0102_0000$$$::"I'm only curious, but you're...hmm."::
36522::$$$message_0267_0103_0000$$$::"What? I'm not obsessed."::
36523::$$$message_0267_0104_0000$$$::Makidera regularly talks about taking advantage of Mitsuzuri, and sees her as her biggest rival.[lr]::
36524::$$$message_0267_0104_0001$$$::Does she see this as a chance to take Mitsuzuri down a notch...?::
36525::$$$message_0267_0105_0000$$$::"...Someone's on the roof, Maki."::
36526::$$$message_0267_0106_0000$$$::"Emiya, obvi[line len=2]oh."::
36527::$$$message_0267_0107_0000$$$::Lost in thought, I stop too late.[lr]::
36528::$$$message_0267_0107_0001$$$::Makidera and Yukika have halted in front of the stairway exit.::
36529::$$$message_0267_0108_0000$$$::I sense an abnormal tension from behind them. Then, carried by the wind...::
36530::$$$message_0267_0109_0000$$$::"...not like that."::
36531::$$$message_0267_0110_0000$$$::"Like I said..."::
36532::$$$message_0267_0111_0000$$$::That isn't just Shirou Emiya's voice.[lr]::
36533::$$$message_0267_0111_0001$$$::Someone else is with him...a voice I recognize.::
36534::$$$message_0267_0112_0000$$$::"...Lady Tohsaka?"::
36535::$$$message_0267_0113_0000$$$::"I wonder what's going on. They're behaving strangely..."::
36536::$$$message_0267_0114_0000$$$::It's hard to hear them from our hiding place.[lr]::
36537::$$$message_0267_0114_0001$$$::The strong breeze drowns out their voices.[lr]::
36538::$$$message_0267_0114_0002$$$::...No, we have business with Shirou Emiya, so it might be best to jump in and interrupt.::
36539::$$$message_0267_0115_0000$$$::"Tohsaka, that's......isn't it..."::
36540::$$$message_0267_0116_0000$$$::"Hmm......saying that...?"::
36541::$$$message_0267_0117_0000$$$::This doesn't seem very peaceful.[lr]::
36542::$$$message_0267_0117_0001$$$::Makidera holds her breath, while Yukika looks puzzled. I can understand why.::
36543::$$$message_0267_0118_0000$$$::Things between those two are so tense that even I can't do anything but hide in the stairwell.[lr]::
36544::$$$message_0267_0118_0001$$$::Shirou Emiya looks confused, but there's also an underlying sense of discomfort that is affecting him.::
36545::$$$message_0267_0119_0000$$$::As for Lady Tohsaka, she's openly showing her emotions more than I've ever seen her do before.[lr]::
36546::$$$message_0267_0119_0001$$$::...I'm not brazen enough to insert myself into this situation.::
36547::$$$message_0267_0120_0000$$$::"W-what do we do, Himuro? Something's off about those two."::
36548::$$$message_0267_0121_0000$$$::"They're having an argument. I can tell."::
36549::$$$message_0267_0122_0000$$$::"Huh? Emiya and Tohsaka are fighting? Wow."::
36550::$$$message_0267_0123_0000$$$::Why does she look happy all of a sudden?[lr]::
36551::$$$message_0267_0123_0001$$$::I have a feeling I need to straighten out Makidera's character at some point.::
36552::$$$message_0267_0124_0000$$$::"That's not it. L-look, I[line len=2]"::
36553::$$$message_0267_0125_0000$$$::"I get it, Shirou. You have Ayako and Saber and Sakura, so do what you want."::
36554::$$$message_0267_0126_0000$$$::I hear Lady Tohsaka's final words very clearly.[lr]::
36555::$$$message_0267_0126_0001$$$::Those provocative words were thrown down, like a divorce letter. [lr]::
36556::$$$message_0267_0126_0002$$$::Emiya, on the receiving end, stood there motionless and indignant.::
36557::$$$message_0267_0127_0000$$$::Then, Tohsaka spins on her heel and starts this way.::
36558::$$$message_0267_0128_0000$$$::"D-did she see us!?"::
36559::$$$message_0267_0129_0000$$$::"No. This is the only exit."::
36560::$$$message_0267_0130_0000$$$::"Then she's [font italic=true]going[font italic=false] to see us!"[wm canskip=0]::
36561::$$$message_0267_0131_0000$$$::She briskly strides our way.[lr]::
36562::$$$message_0267_0131_0001$$$::I feel sick. If Lady Tohsaka sees our disgraceful behavior...::
36563::$$$message_0267_0132_0000$$$::"Let's get out of here, Himuro!"::
36564::$$$message_0267_0133_0000$$$::"Understood."::
36565::$$$message_0267_0134_0000$$$::Makidera and I dash off like rabbits.::
36566::$$$message_0267_0135_0000$$$::I don't mean to boast, but I'm confident in my short-distance dashes. Makidera is our mid-distance ace. It should be easy for us to outrun a Tohsaka or two, but...[lr]::
36567::$$$message_0267_0135_0001$$$::One of our companions doesn't have such athletic abilities.::
36568::$$$message_0267_0136_0000$$$::"W-wait! I..."::
36569::$$$message_0267_0137_0000$$$::A pitiful cry comes from behind.[lr]::
36570::$$$message_0267_0137_0001$$$::If she forces herself to run, she's likely to trip and fall down the stairs. Makidera and I exchange glances.::
36571::$$$message_0267_0138_0000$$$::"Help her, Maki."::
36572::$$$message_0267_0139_0000$$$::"Roger that!"::
36573::$$$message_0267_0140_0000$$$::"[large]Wahahaha![rf] That was amazing, right, Himuro!?"::
36574::$$$message_0267_0141_0000$$$::"What is? It is impressive you can run while carrying Yukika, though."::
36575::$$$message_0267_0142_0000$$$::"Not that. Emiya and Tohsaka's fight. Woohoo!"[lr]::
36576::$$$message_0267_0142_0001$$$::She's on an emotional high.::
36577::$$$message_0267_0143_0000$$$::We arrive back at our classroom and catch our breaths after that unanticipated exertion.::
36578::$$$message_0267_0144_0000$$$::"Huh...I'm dizzy..."::
36579::$$$message_0267_0145_0000$$$::"Oh, I must've shaken you a bit. My bad, Yukicchi."::
36580::$$$message_0267_0146_0000$$$::Makidera sets Yukika down, not looking winded in the least.[lr]::
36581::$$$message_0267_0146_0001$$$::But her heart's probably pounding faster than mine.[lr]::
36582::$$$message_0267_0146_0002$$$::There are fewer students than usual during lunchtime, but our remaining classmates are looking our way.[lr]::
36583::$$$message_0267_0146_0003$$$::We go back to our desks and sit down.::
36584::$$$message_0267_0147_0000$$$::"...Oh, no. I forgot to ask Emiya about Ryudou."::
36585::$$$message_0267_0148_0000$$$::"Eh? Oh, you're right. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01d(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01d(中) textoff=0]Not like it matters now, though."::
36586::$$$message_0267_0149_0000$$$::Makidera plops down across from me and starts to open up her lunch.[lr]::
36587::$$$message_0267_0149_0001$$$::I'm impressed she hasn't eaten her lunch before lunchtime today.::
36588::$$$message_0267_0150_0000$$$::"It does matter. We didn't learn anything about Issei Ryudou and Ayako Mitsuzuri's relationship."::
36589::$$$message_0267_0151_0000$$$::"That's no big deal. It doesn't matter now whether they're together or not. What's important is Tohsaka and Emiya's fight, am I right?"::
36590::$$$message_0267_0152_0000$$$::Makidera lowers her voice, relishing the hot scoop.::
36591::$$$message_0267_0153_0000$$$::We did witness something unexpected, but our goal is Ayako Mitsuzuri.::
36592::$$$message_0267_0154_0000$$$::After a moment, Yukika totters over with her lunchbox and sits by us.[lr]::
36593::$$$message_0267_0154_0001$$$::Compared to Makidera's good mood, Yukika seems somewhat dispirited.::
36594::$$$message_0267_0155_0000$$$::"Yeah... Miss Tohsaka seemed pretty upset."::
36595::$$$message_0267_0156_0000$$$::"It's because Emiya's a blockhead. I knew things wouldn't work out with Tohsaka. Hehehe. This is good, mhm."::
36596::$$$message_0267_0157_0000$$$::Makidera digs into her food with gusto.[lr]::
36597::$$$message_0267_0157_0001$$$::The spectacle must have really pleased her, because she's making a face like she just won at life. What a troublesome girl.::
36598::$$$message_0267_0158_0000$$$::"...But Maki, I don't think it's good to fight..."::
36599::$$$message_0267_0159_0000$$$::"There wasn't much we could have done to help. Lady Tohsaka[line len=2]::
36600::$$$message_0267_0160_0000$$$::Speak of the devil, and she appears.::
36601::$$$message_0267_0161_0000$$$::I silence myself and watch her movements. Did she notice us running away?[lr]::
36602::$$$message_0267_0161_0001$$$::Makidera shrinks down, trying to hide.[lr]::
36603::$$$message_0267_0161_0002$$$::Yukika almost calls out to Lady Tohsaka, but stops herself.::
36604::$$$message_0267_0162_0000$$$::"..."::
36605::$$$message_0267_0163_0000$$$::Lady Tohsaka makes her way over to her seat and unwraps her lunchbox.::
36606::$$$message_0267_0164_0000$$$::She must not have finished her food, after leaving the roof in that manner.[lr]::
36607::$$$message_0267_0164_0001$$$::She glances our way, but doesn't seem interested in us.[lr]::
36608::$$$message_0267_0164_0002$$$::The air she gives off dominates the classroom.[lr]::
36609::$$$message_0267_0164_0003$$$::It feels hard to raise our voices, all the more so after witnessing the argument.::
36610::$$$message_0267_0165_0000$$$::"...She's mad. Pissed."::
36611::$$$message_0267_0166_0000$$$::"I wonder what Emiya did. Anyway, let's have lunch."::
36612::$$$message_0267_0167_0000$$$::"Yeah... Ah...I feel bad... What should I do..."::
36613::$$$message_0267_0168_0000$$$::We don't speak much. I don't have much hope that today's lunch will go well. Makidera is elated, but Yukika is sad, and I'm still grappling with our questions.[lr]::
36614::$$$message_0267_0168_0001$$$::[se storage=se020.wav]Then, lunch break ends.[sestop time=3000 storage=se255.wav][lr]::
36615::$$$message_0267_0168_0002$$$::The situation surrounding Mitsuzuri and Tohsaka has become even more confusing...::
36616::$$$message_0267_0169_0000$$$::"Mitsuzuri-senpai? She isn't here today, but I can take a message for you."::
36617::$$$message_0267_0170_0000$$$::"Hey... Actually, my sister's still on campus. I saw her in the building earlier."::
36618::$$$message_0267_0171_0000$$$::"I see. Sorry for intruding."::
36619::$$$message_0267_0172_0000$$$::"Emiya? Maybe he's at work. He left right after class."::
36620::$$$message_0267_0173_0000$$$::"Ahh, he might be in the student council room. I still see him coming and going. But I dunno, he seems to be everywhere and nowhere at once."::
36621::$$$message_0267_0174_0000$$$::I can't get in touch with Ayako Mitsuzuri or Shirou Emiya.[lr]::
36622::$$$message_0267_0174_0001$$$::Makidera and Yukika aren't with me right now, so I'm trying to investigate Mitsuzuri on my own.[lr]::
36623::$$$message_0267_0174_0002$$$::Makidera is passionate, but she's useless once her interests shift off target. Yukika is still troubled after seeing Lady Tohsaka and Emiya's argument, so I don't want to make her any more uncomfortable.::
36624::$$$message_0267_0175_0000$$$::"..."::
36625::$$$message_0267_0176_0000$$$::But this is strange.::
36626::$$$message_0267_0177_0000$$$::I began looking into Ayako Mitsuzuri purely out of curiosity, but now that Lady Tohsaka and Emiya are involved, it's created an oppressive tension. And yet...::
36627::$$$message_0267_0178_0000$$$::Tohsaka and Emiya's deteriorating relationship and Mitsuzuri's potential partner are two separate issues.::
36628::$$$message_0267_0179_0000$$$::"Still, though..."::
36629::$$$message_0267_0180_0000$$$::I mutter to myself, making my way to the student council room.::
36630::$$$message_0267_0181_0000$$$::"I suppose I'll have to ask the president directly..."::
36631::$$$message_0267_0182_0000$$$::If Emiya's there, I can pull him aside and ask my questions.[lr]::
36632::$$$message_0267_0182_0001$$$::If only Ryudou is there, my only option is to question directly and clarify his relationship with Mitsuzuri.[lr]::
36633::$$$message_0267_0182_0002$$$::I'm not sure why I feel so obligated to pursue this, but it wouldn't sit right with me if I left this unfinished.::
36634::$$$message_0267_0183_0000$$$::"This is Himuro, the third year. I'm coming in."::
36635::$$$message_0267_0184_0000$$$::The student council room isn't busy.[lr]::
36636::$$$message_0267_0184_0001$$$::The current generation of student council members acts as if they are a business.::
36637::$$$message_0267_0185_0000$$$::Sure enough, its most passionate member is still here by himself.::
36638::$$$message_0267_0186_0000$$$::Shirou Emiya isn't present.::
36639::$$$message_0267_0187_0000$$$::"...Working overtime, temple boy?"::
36640::$$$message_0267_0188_0000$$$::"Hmph. I have to prepare the handover documents by the end of the year. A daughter of a government official would probably be used to seeing people work hard as we approach December."::
36641::$$$message_0267_0189_0000$$$::Issei Ryudou, the student council president, purses his lips.[lr]::
36642::$$$message_0267_0189_0001$$$::No need to rehash how handsome he is, but his displeasure is clearly directed at me.::
36643::$$$message_0267_0190_0000$$$::"Still not used to me calling you that, I see."::
36644::$$$message_0267_0191_0000$$$::"I do have a name: Issei Ryudou. Wouldn't you be offended if someone called you 'temple girl' every time they saw you?"::
36645::$$$message_0267_0192_0000$$$::He's prickly with people he doesn't know well.::
36646::$$$message_0267_0193_0000$$$::I make a quick bow. No point in antagonizing him further.::
36647::$$$message_0267_0194_0000$$$::"Excuse me. Then, Issei Ryudou."::
36648::$$$message_0267_0195_0000$$$::"...Good. What business do you have with the student council, Kane Himuro?"::
36649::$$$message_0267_0196_0000$$$::"It isn't related to my class or club. I'm here to speak with you about something personal."::
36650::$$$message_0267_0197_0000$$$::Ryudou raises his eyebrow.[lr]::
36651::$$$message_0267_0197_0001$$$::Makes sense. It must sound strange, coming from me.::
36652::$$$message_0267_0198_0000$$$::He gestures towards a chair, and I sit down. What a relief. I thought he was going to shoo me away.::
36653::$$$message_0267_0199_0000$$$::I sit up straight and face Ryudou.::
36654::$$$message_0267_0200_0000$$$::"Something about me?"::
36655::$$$message_0267_0201_0000$$$::"...Ryudou, are you dating Ayako Mitsuzuri?"::
36656::$$$message_0267_0202_0000$$$::I cut straight to the point.::
36657::$$$message_0267_0203_0000$$$::"Wha... What do you mean, d-dating!?"::
36658::$$$message_0267_0204_0000$$$::"Temple boy, you're acting very flustered right now. [cacheimage storage=氷室制服01b(中)][wvl canskip=false time=600][chgfg time=200 storage=氷室制服01b(中) textoff=0]I see... I'll take my leave now."::
36659::$$$message_0267_0205_0000$$$::"[large]Wait, [rf]hold on, [large]stop right there, [rf]Kane Himuro! Don't just leave!"::
36660::$$$message_0267_0206_0000$$$::He grabs my sleeve to halt my departure.[lr]::
36661::$$$message_0267_0206_0001$$$::Our calm and disciplined student council president is in considerable dismay.::
36662::$$$message_0267_0207_0000$$$::"I've asked what I came to ask, and I wouldn't want to disturb your work any further. Feel free to forget I ever asked."::
36663::$$$message_0267_0208_0000$$$::"As if I could! [cacheimage storage=一成02a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成02a(中) textoff=0]Who in the world can simply forget being suddenly asked if they're dating Ayako Mitsuzuri!"::
36664::$$$message_0267_0209_0000$$$::Ryudou snaps at me.[lr]::
36665::$$$message_0267_0209_0001$$$::I think it would be best for his own sake if he didn't get involved any further, but perhaps we're past that point.::
36666::$$$message_0267_0210_0000$$$::"What put the idea that we're dating into your head, anyway?"::
36667::$$$message_0267_0211_0000$$$::"...You're the only candidate I could think of that could strike a balance with Lady Mitsuzuri."::
36668::$$$message_0267_0212_0000$$$::Ryudou nods.[lr]::
36669::$$$message_0267_0212_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成03e(中),氷室制服02d(中) textoff=0]Just when I think he's convinced, he furrows his brow.::
36670::$$$message_0267_0213_0000$$$::"While I'm honored you consider her my peer, that doesn't answer my question."::
36671::$$$message_0267_0214_0000$$$::"I'm surprised you're even interested in such topics."::
36672::$$$message_0267_0215_0000$$$::"...We were talking about whether Lady Mitsuzuri is dating anyone, and I'm just here to satisfy my curiosity."::
36673::$$$message_0267_0216_0000$$$::I think that should answer his question.::
36674::$$$message_0267_0217_0000$$$::"Based on your reaction earlier, could it be that you have someone you're interested in?"::
36675::$$$message_0267_0218_0000$$$::"I can't say I'm dissatisfied with the face you made."::
36676::$$$message_0267_0219_0000$$$::"W-what are you talking about? Don't you have anyone you respect!?"::
36677::$$$message_0267_0220_0000$$$::"There are many people I respect. You're one of them, and I don't mean that as flattery. [cacheimage storage=氷室制服01a(中),一成03b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服01a(中),一成03b(中) textoff=0]Stop looking at me like that. It's rude."::
36678::$$$message_0267_0221_0000$$$::"...Mm, yes, I have to admit I'm pleased to hear that from someone I also res[line len=2][cacheimage storage=一成02a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成02a(中) textoff=0]actually, no, I'll consider it flattery after all."::
36679::$$$message_0267_0222_0000$$$::Ryudou clears his throat.[lr]::
36680::$$$message_0267_0222_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02d(中) textoff=0]I'm not sure if his modesty is a virtue or a vice.::
36681::$$$message_0267_0223_0000$$$::"Still, this is the first time I've ever heard of Mitsuzuri dating anyone."::
36682::$$$message_0267_0224_0000$$$::"...I just heard about it yesterday, too. The first candidate was Shinji Matou, followed by you."::
36683::$$$message_0267_0225_0000$$$::"Shinji? Inconceivable."::
36684::$$$message_0267_0226_0000$$$::Ryudou screws up his face.[lr]::
36685::$$$message_0267_0226_0001$$$::Recalling what happened in the woods yesterday, I feel a slight headache coming on.::
36686::$$$message_0267_0227_0000$$$::"When I asked Sakura Matou about it, she was wide-eyed."::
36687::$$$message_0267_0228_0000$$$::"Haha, I imagine it was disastrous for her as well. But I agree with her that Shinji Matou would be impossible... [cacheimage storage=一成01c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成01c(中) textoff=0]Hm, who would Mitsuzuri date..."::
36688::$$$message_0267_0229_0000$$$::Ryudou falls into contemplation, his interest piqued.[lr]::
36689::$$$message_0267_0229_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成02a(中) textoff=0]Finally, he lets out a long sigh.::
36690::$$$message_0267_0230_0000$$$::"We'd be fortunate if Emiya and Mitsuzuri were dating."::
36691::$$$message_0267_0231_0000$$$::"......"::
36692::$$$message_0267_0232_0000$$$::Shirou Emiya and Ayako Mitsuzuri.[lr]::
36693::$$$message_0267_0232_0001$$$::[fg left=228 opacity=0 index=3000 top=173 time=200 storage=氷室制服02e(近) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 time=800 pos=c accel=0 storage=氷室制服02e(近) textoff=0]I hadn't even considered that possibility.[wm canskip=0][lr]::
36694::$$$message_0267_0232_0002$$$::[rep storages=美綴01a(中),士郎制服01a(中),氷室制服02e(近) time=400 opacities=187,187, monos=1,1, poss=r,l,c bg=white colors=0xBB6e6e6e,0xBB6E6E6E, indexes=1000,2000,3000 textoff=0]Of course! After all...::
36695::$$$message_0267_0233_0000$$$::"But Madam Himuro, Emiya is dating Rin Tohsaka, remember? [cacheimage storage=氷室制服02a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=氷室制服02a(中) textoff=0]That [large]witch, [rf][large]Tohsaka.[rf] She's a vixen, a she-demon. I can't believe she got her claws into Emiya!"::
36696::$$$message_0267_0234_0000$$$::"And Emiya seems happy with that! Don't you think that's awful!?"::
36697::$$$message_0267_0235_0000$$$::I'd completely excluded Emiya as an option because of Lady Tohsaka.[lr]::
36698::$$$message_0267_0235_0001$$$::Ryudou rambles on, getting somewhat worked up.::
36699::$$$message_0267_0236_0000$$$::"I [font italic=true]told[font italic=false] him to leave that vixen.[lr]::
36700::$$$message_0267_0236_0001$$$::His moral decency is ripe pickings for Tohsaka's devilish charms."::
36701::$$$message_0267_0237_0000$$$::"No matter how many times I warn him, he only falls further into her clutches. [cacheimage storage=一成02a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成02a(中) textoff=0]The shame of it. Utterly scandalous."::
36702::$$$message_0267_0238_0000$$$::"..."::
36703::$$$message_0267_0239_0000$$$::Is he absorbed in cursing his longtime nemesis Tohsaka, or whole-heartedly lamenting his friend's fall from grace?::
36704::$$$message_0267_0240_0000$$$::"I'm not sure I should be hearing all this verbal abuse."::
36705::$$$message_0267_0241_0000$$$::"Mrgh, right... Anyway, it's unfortunate that Emiya and Tohsaka are dating."::
36706::$$$message_0267_0242_0000$$$::"Ahh, if only he was with Ayako Mitsuzuri or Miss Saber instead, I, Issei Ryudou, would happily bless and support them..."::
36707::$$$message_0267_0243_0000$$$::Saber?[lr]::
36708::$$$message_0267_0243_0001$$$::That's a name I haven't heard. Is she a foreigner?::
36709::$$$message_0267_0244_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02d(中) textoff=0]The fact that Ryudou called her "Miss" implies that they're acquainted, too... It's not every day you find out Ryudou has a female associate he gets along with that well.::
36710::$$$message_0267_0245_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02a(中) textoff=0]Then, it hits me.[lr]::
36711::$$$message_0267_0245_0001$$$::I realize that I'm interacting with him right now on quite familiar terms, too.::
36712::$$$message_0267_0246_0000$$$::"...Honestly, I'd even prefer it if you were his partner, Himuro."::
36713::$$$message_0267_0247_0000$$$::"You're suddenly saying some scandalous things now, too.[lr]::
36714::$$$message_0267_0247_0001$$$::I'd love for the person in question to hear this. I wonder how he'd react."::
36715::$$$message_0267_0248_0000$$$::"Wha..."::
36716::$$$message_0267_0249_0000$$$::So this ex-president's weakness is Shirou Emiya, eh?::
36717::$$$message_0267_0250_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02d(中) textoff=0]There's Makidera and Lady Tohsaka, then him and Emiya. It's so hard to understand the obsessions of the people around me.::
36718::$$$message_0267_0251_0000$$$::"I think it's better that you don't."::
36719::$$$message_0267_0252_0000$$$::"Of course. I failed to get ahold of him, anyway. When I went to ask him about it, he was in the middle of an argument with Lady Tohsaka."::
36720::$$$message_0267_0253_0000$$$::I know it's in poor taste to bring this up now.::
36721::$$$message_0267_0254_0000$$$::But Ryudou's expression transforms into that of someone who's just heard good news.::
36722::$$$message_0267_0255_0000$$$::"Oh...? Is that true?"::
36723::$$$message_0267_0256_0000$$$::"I don't have anything to gain by lying.[lr]::
36724::$$$message_0267_0256_0001$$$::They were probably having a typical lovers' spat."::
36725::$$$message_0267_0257_0000$$$::...Whether that's the case or not, there are people who are rejoicing over it. Like Makidera, and Issei Ryudou.::
36726::$$$message_0267_0258_0000$$$::I can imagine Lady Tohsaka lamenting, "why are you enjoying someone else's misery so much?"[lr]::
36727::$$$message_0267_0258_0001$$$::[chgfg time=200 storage=凛制服14b(中),氷室制服02b(近) textoff=0]I'd tell her it's the fate of the beautiful. She has to learn to accept that.::
36728::$$$message_0267_0259_0000$$$::"Himuro?"::
36729::$$$message_0267_0260_0000$$$::"...It's nothing. Anyway, my inquiry into Ayako Mitsuzuri's significant other has run into a rough patch."::
36730::$$$message_0267_0261_0000$$$::"Ah... I know that Mitsuzuri doesn't seem to get along with Miss Rider, one of Emiya's associates. [cacheimage storage=一成01b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成01b(中) textoff=0]But I can't think of any reason why Rider would feel the same way."::
36731::$$$message_0267_0262_0000$$$::Another name I've never heard.[lr]::
36732::$$$message_0267_0262_0001$$$::Is it a nickname, or her actual name?[lr]::
36733::$$$message_0267_0262_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02a(中) textoff=0]...Saber sounds like a fencer or cavalier, while Rider sounds like a pilot or driver. Whether it's a surname or a given name, it's a bit strange.::
36734::$$$message_0267_0263_0000$$$::In any case, Ryudou doesn't have any solid leads on Mitsuzuri's significant other.[lr]::
36735::$$$message_0267_0263_0001$$$::[line len=3][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02d(中) textoff=0]No, there is one possibility now.::
36736::$$$message_0267_0264_0000$$$::I wonder how much time has passed.[lr]::
36737::$$$message_0267_0264_0001$$$::It's starting to get noisy outside. This office is serene by comparison.::
36738::$$$message_0267_0265_0000$$$::"...Would you like some tea, Himuro?"::
36739::$$$message_0267_0266_0000$$$::"I'm surprised. To think that you and I could have such a friendly chat, President Ryudou."::
36740::$$$message_0267_0267_0000$$$::"...True. I never meant to avoid you, but we just never interacted much before."::
36741::$$$message_0267_0268_0000$$$::"If the student council leadership was blessed with someone of your talents, things would be..."::
36742::$$$message_0267_0269_0000$$$::"Himuro! [cacheimage storage=一成03b(中),氷室制服01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成03b(中),氷室制服01a(中) textoff=0]You in here!?"[rf]::
36743::$$$message_0267_0270_0000$$$::Suddenly, the door to the student council room flies open.[lr]::
36744::$$$message_0267_0270_0001$$$::Actually, it wouldn't be an exaggeration to say it was kicked open.::
36745::$$$message_0267_0271_0000$$$::"If it isn't Makidera. Don't you care to knock?"::
36746::$$$message_0267_0272_0000$$$::"Makino-G, you shouldn't be so rough with school facilities."::
36747::$$$message_0267_0273_0000$$$::"What are you two so calm for!?"::
36748::$$$message_0267_0274_0000$$$::Makidera seems fired up for some reason.[lr]::
36749::$$$message_0267_0274_0001$$$::When Makidera barges into the room, Ryudou's attitude becomes openly cold.::
36750::$$$message_0267_0275_0000$$$::"I was looking for you, Himuro! Something big's happening!"::
36751::$$$message_0267_0276_0000$$$::"That's not very specific.[lr]::
36752::$$$message_0267_0276_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服01c(中) textoff=0]You could have just called or sent a text."::
36753::$$$message_0267_0277_0000$$$::"That doesn't matter now! Let's go!"::
36754::$$$message_0267_0278_0000$$$::She pulls me away by the sleeve.[lr]::
36755::$$$message_0267_0278_0001$$$::I wonder how the stars aligned to make me get pulled by the sleeve so many times in the student council room today.::
36756::$$$message_0267_0279_0000$$$::"Your friend's very loud."::
36757::$$$message_0267_0280_0000$$$::"She's maddening even when she's quiet. Sorry, I'll have the tea another time."::
36758::$$$message_0267_0281_0000$$$::"[large]Come on[rf], hurry up[cacheimage storage=氷室制服01b(近),蒔寺制服02a(近)][wvl][movefg opacity=255 left=-405 top=54 time=300 accel=2 storage=氷室制服01b(近) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-722 top=149 time=270 accel=2 storage=蒔寺制服02a(近) textoff=0]! Just leave the temple boy!"[cacheimage storage=一成03b(中)][wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][chgfg time=300 storage=一成03b(中) textoff=0]::
36759::$$$message_0267_0282_0000$$$::From behind, I hear Ryudou say, "Makidera, I don't remember you calling me temple boy before," but by then we're already running off.[lr]::
36760::$$$message_0267_0282_0001$$$::I don't like running in hallways at school, but I don't have a choice when Makidera's like this.::
36761::$$$message_0267_0283_0000$$$::"What happened?"::
36762::$$$message_0267_0284_0000$$$::"There's a hot scoop! Yukicchi's keeping the scene under control."::
36763::$$$message_0267_0285_0000$$$::I run next to Makidera, and glance at her face...[fg left=606 index=2000 top=27 opacity=0 time=200 storage=蒔寺制服01d(近) textoff=0][fg left=353 opacity=0 index=2000 top=49 time=200 storage=蒔寺制服03c(近) textoff=0]::
36764::$$$message_0267_0286_0000$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 left=269 top=27 time=400 accel=-2 storage=蒔寺制服01d(近) textoff=0][wm canskip=0 textoff=0][say storage=mapex11_mak_0440 name=蒔寺]Guhehehe... [movefg opacity=0 left=365 top=27 time=300 accel=2 storage=蒔寺制服01d(近) textoff=0][wvl canskip=false time=200][move time=100 path=(332,34,255)(316,56,255)(305,35,255)(289,59,255)(268,31,255)(248,60,255)(194,28,255)(152,58,255) accel=-1 storage=蒔寺制服03c(近) spline=1 textoff=0]We've got this in the bag!"[wvs][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
36765::$$$message_0267_0287_0000$$$::   Why do I feel so uneasy?::
36766::$$$message_0267_0288_0000$$$::"Ah, Maki, [cacheimage storage=由紀香制服01c(遠)][wvl][movefg opacity=255 time=130 pos=l accel=-2 storage=由紀香制服01c(遠) textoff=0][wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=255 left=105 top=156 time=130 accel=2 storage=由紀香制服01c(遠) textoff=0][wm canskip=0]over here, [cacheimage storage=由紀香制服01c(遠)][wvl][movefg opacity=255 time=130 pos=l accel=-2 storage=由紀香制服01c(遠) textoff=0][wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=255 left=105 top=156 time=130 accel=2 storage=由紀香制服01c(遠) textoff=0][wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=255 time=130 pos=l accel=-2 storage=由紀香制服01c(遠) textoff=0][wm canskip=0]over here."::
36767::$$$message_0267_0289_0000$$$::"Okay, Yukicchi. You're still here."::
36768::$$$message_0267_0290_0000$$$::We stop and lower our voices.[lr]::
36769::$$$message_0267_0290_0001$$$::[fg color=0xff6C6C6C index=4000 time=300 pos=r mono=1 storage=氷室制服01a(近) textoff=0]Is there something around the corner?::
36770::$$$message_0267_0291_0000$$$::"...Oh?"::
36771::$$$message_0267_0292_0000$$$::Ayako Mitsuzuri and Shirou Emiya are on the staircase landing.[lr]::
36772::$$$message_0267_0292_0001$$$::How curious. What is the pairing I just discussed in the student council room doing here...?::
36773::$$$message_0267_0293_0000$$$::"See? Hot scoop, am I right?"::
36774::$$$message_0267_0294_0000$$$::"Miss Mitsuzuri and Emiya have been talking this whooole time. They look like they're enjoying themselves."::
36775::$$$message_0267_0295_0000$$$::Yukika is right. They're having a friendly conversation.[lr]::
36776::$$$message_0267_0295_0001$$$::It's a stark contrast to his lunchtime quarrel with Lady Tohsaka that we witnessed from afar.[lr]::
36777::$$$message_0267_0295_0002$$$::Emiya's his usual stone-faced self, but Lady Mitsuzuri on the other hand...::
36778::$$$message_0267_0296_0000$$$::"Oh, she laughed."::
36779::$$$message_0267_0297_0000$$$::"Miss Mitsuzuri's laughing."::
36780::$$$message_0267_0298_0000$$$::"...They seem quite close."::
36781::$$$message_0267_0299_0000$$$::I voice my sincere thoughts.[lr]::
36782::$$$message_0267_0299_0001$$$::I often see Ayako Mitsuzuri angry rather than happy, though not to the same extent as Tohsaka.[lr]::
36783::$$$message_0267_0299_0002$$$::But the way she just tapped Emiya on the chest while talking is not her usual self.::
36784::$$$message_0267_0300_0000$$$::"Wow...she's really friendly with Emiya."::
36785::$$$message_0267_0301_0000$$$::"They were always... No, but I didn't know they were this close. Well, well..."::
36786::$$$message_0267_0302_0000$$$::"...[chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香制服01c(中) textoff=0]..."::
36787::$$$message_0267_0303_0000$$$::"...I wonder what they're talking about."::
36788::$$$message_0267_0304_0000$$$::"We can't hear them, but we also can't just go over there..."::
36789::$$$message_0267_0305_0000$$$::"..."::
36790::$$$message_0267_0306_0000$$$::Yukika's complexion doesn't look good.[lr]::
36791::$$$message_0267_0306_0001$$$::Of course. [chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01d(中) textoff=0]Who wouldn't be uncomfortable delving into Tohsaka and Mitsuzuri's private lives in this manner? Yukika's always had a good heart, so it must particularly [chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02b(近),蒔寺制服02d(中) textoff=0]pain her.[lr]::
36792::$$$message_0267_0306_0002$$$::Much more could be said of Makidera, whose eyes are twinkling without a speck of guilt.::
36793::$$$message_0267_0307_0000$$$::"...Did you say something, Himuro?"::
36794::$$$message_0267_0308_0000$$$::"No, I was just feeling ashamed of my actions.[lr]::
36795::$$$message_0267_0308_0001$$$::Still, this pair is both unexpected and expected."::
36796::$$$message_0267_0309_0000$$$::"What do you mean?"::
36797::$$$message_0267_0310_0000$$$::Makidera turns to me, perplexed.[lr]::
36798::$$$message_0267_0310_0001$$$::However, the scene in the hallway changes before I can answer.::
36799::$$$message_0267_0311_0000$$$::"Ah..."::
36800::$$$message_0267_0312_0000$$$::"They're finished talking...[cacheimage storage=美綴01b(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=美綴01b(遠) textoff=0]but..."::
36801::$$$message_0267_0313_0000$$$::Mitsuzuri laughs and goes down the stairs.[lr]::
36802::$$$message_0267_0313_0001$$$::[clfg time=300 rule=シャッター左から storage=士郎制服01a(遠) textoff=0]Emiya is coming this way.[lr]::
36803::$$$message_0267_0313_0002$$$::[playstop time=400 nowait=true]Should we run again? [quake vmax=15 hmax=0 time=500 textoff=0]A wave of unease passes amongst us.[lr]::
36804::$$$message_0267_0313_0003$$$::But there's no time.::
36805::$$$message_0267_0314_0000$$$::"..."::
36806::$$$message_0267_0315_0000$$$::Emiya takes one puzzled look at us before walking away.[lr]::
36807::$$$message_0267_0315_0001$$$::[clfg time=600 rule=シャッター左から storage=士郎制服01c(中) textoff=0]Nobody says anything.::
36808::$$$message_0267_0316_0000$$$::"...Haaah."::
36809::$$$message_0267_0317_0000$$$::Yukicchi finally sighs in relief.[lr]::
36810::$$$message_0267_0317_0001$$$::Emiya and Mitsuzuri are both gone, taking my anxiety with them.[lr]::
36811::$$$message_0267_0317_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服01a(中),蒔寺制服04c(中) textoff=0]Makidera's shoulders shake as she lets out an inexplicable laugh.::
36812::$$$message_0267_0318_0000$$$::"I think we just witnessed something...amazing."::
36813::$$$message_0267_0319_0000$$$::"It sure was worth tailing Emiya. I was looking forward to seeing what he'd pull."::
36814::$$$message_0267_0320_0000$$$::"So only my efforts were in vain."::
36815::$$$message_0267_0321_0000$$$::I'm frustrated that Makidera stole my thunder.[lr]::
36816::$$$message_0267_0321_0001$$$::Though, I didn't come up completely empty-handed.::
36817::$$$message_0267_0322_0000$$$::"What were you doing in the student council room with Ryudou, anyway?"::
36818::$$$message_0267_0323_0000$$$::"Oh, were you with Ryudou?"::
36819::$$$message_0267_0324_0000$$$::Makidera seems to have just remembered where I was.[lr]::
36820::$$$message_0267_0324_0001$$$::It's not really relevant anymore, but it's not worth hiding anything from them either.::
36821::$$$message_0267_0325_0000$$$::"I went to ask Ryudou directly whether he was dating Mitsuzuri."::
36822::$$$message_0267_0326_0000$$$::"Whaaa!? And what'd he say!?"::
36823::$$$message_0267_0327_0000$$$::"He easily denied it. It seems that his affections lie elsewhere."::
36824::$$$message_0267_0328_0000$$$::"Huh. So the great president had an amusing secret like that."::
36825::$$$message_0267_0329_0000$$$::This is troublesome indeed.[lr]::
36826::$$$message_0267_0329_0001$$$::The situation around Mitsuzuri is already so complicated, but now I'm letting Ryudou, Makidera, and other factors confuse me. We should take a lesson from Yukika. She's so reserved, good-natured, and cooperative.[lr]::
36827::$$$message_0267_0329_0002$$$::I try to imagine Makidera with all of those traits...and give up.::
36828::$$$message_0267_0330_0000$$$::"Really... They would've made such a nice couple."::
36829::$$$message_0267_0331_0000$$$::"I wanted it to be true, too. They would look picture-perfect."::
36830::$$$message_0267_0332_0000$$$::"So, what about this couple? Do they make for a lovely picture?"::
36831::$$$message_0267_0333_0000$$$::It's clear who she's referring to: [lr]::
36832::$$$message_0267_0333_0001$$$::Ayako Mitsuzuri and Shirou Emiya.::
36833::$$$message_0267_0334_0000$$$::"Maki, do you mean..."::
36834::$$$message_0267_0335_0000$$$::"Yeah, Emiya and Mitsuzuri, right? [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01d(中) textoff=0]I had no idea they were that close."::
36835::$$$message_0267_0336_0000$$$::Makidera looks genuinely pleased.[lr]::
36836::$$$message_0267_0336_0001$$$::However, [chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香制服01b(中) textoff=0]I don't share her enthusiasm. This smells like trouble.[chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香制服01a(中) textoff=0]::
36837::$$$message_0267_0337_0000$$$::"...I'm not sure. Emiya used to be in the kyudo club, and I've heard that Lady Mitsuzuri tried hard to persuade him to stay. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01c(中) textoff=0]She's even been trying to get him to come back, apparently."::
36838::$$$message_0267_0338_0000$$$::"Yeah, Emiya's good at archery, apparently. I even heard Ms. Fujimura say that he could compete on the national level."::
36839::$$$message_0267_0339_0000$$$::"But when Ms. Fujimura was a student... What was it again? Wasn't there some legend about the Fuyuki Tiger?"::
36840::$$$message_0267_0340_0000$$$::The rumored Tiger of Fuyuki is more like an urban legend than a claim to fame, at this point.[lr]::
36841::$$$message_0267_0340_0001$$$::Back to the subject at hand...::
36842::$$$message_0267_0341_0000$$$::"Anyway, this goes to show that Emiya is still in touch with Lady Mitsuzuri even after leaving the kyudo club."::
36843::$$$message_0267_0342_0000$$$::"Shinji was the vice-captain at the time. I would've done the same thing in Mitsuzuri's shoes, especially if Emiya was that good."::
36844::$$$message_0267_0343_0000$$$::"Yeah..."::
36845::$$$message_0267_0344_0000$$$::Makidera agrees, while Yukika looks sad.[lr]::
36846::$$$message_0267_0344_0001$$$::If Emiya and Mitsuzuri are dating, then that would leave Lady Tohsaka out in the cold. That would be a tough pill to swallow for Yukika, who's fond of Lady Tohsaka.::
36847::$$$message_0267_0345_0000$$$::"What if Mitsuzuri made advances on him, instead of trying to get him to stay in the club?"::
36848::$$$message_0267_0346_0000$$$::"That doesn't make sense, Maki. It would've happened before he and Tohsaka were together..."::
36849::$$$message_0267_0347_0000$$$::Yukika's right. If Lady Mitsuzuri started dating Emiya after he quit the kyudo club, [chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01e(中) textoff=0]there would have been signs of that sooner.[lr]::
36850::$$$message_0267_0347_0001$$$::Furthermore, it would mean that Lady Tohsaka poached Emiya from Mitsuzuri, which would have severely damaged the relationship between the two[line len=2]no, all three of them.::
36851::$$$message_0267_0348_0000$$$::However, the evidence indicates otherwise.[lr]::
36852::$$$message_0267_0348_0001$$$::I haven't heard anything about Mitsuzuri and Tohsaka's friendship worsening, and if it had, then Mitsuzuri's behavior would have changed back in the spring.[lr]::
36853::$$$message_0267_0348_0002$$$::In conclusion, Lady Tohsaka started dating Emiya first. That much seems certain.::
36854::$$$message_0267_0349_0000$$$::"Ah... Right. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01a(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01a(中) textoff=0]So what's going on, exactly?"::
36855::$$$message_0267_0350_0000$$$::"A difficult question, but there must be a logic to it. Let me think."::
36856::$$$message_0267_0351_0000$$$::I beckon my friends into position.[lr]::
36857::$$$message_0267_0351_0001$$$::[rep fliplr=1 tops=,59,75 storages=蒔寺制服01e(遠),氷室制服01a(中),由紀香制服02c(中) time=600 flipudr=0 lefts=,563,43 poss=c,, bg=i学園廊下 indexes=1000,2000,3000 textoff=0]The three of us form an equilateral triangle.::
36858::$$$message_0267_0352_0000$$$::"What you doing, Kane?"::
36859::$$$message_0267_0353_0000$$$::"I'm spacing us out evenly as an example. How about this?"::
36860::$$$message_0267_0354_0000$$$::"???"::
36861::$$$message_0267_0355_0000$$$::"I don't get it. What are we doing?"::
36862::$$$message_0267_0356_0000$$$::The other two seem confused.::
36863::$$$message_0267_0357_0000$$$::"Then, I'll do this."::
36864::$$$message_0267_0358_0000$$$::"Huh?"::
36865::$$$message_0267_0359_0000$$$::I step sideways and get behind Yukika.[lr]::
36866::$$$message_0267_0359_0001$$$::Then, I suddenly wrap my arms around her waist.::
36867::$$$message_0267_0360_0000$$$::"W-what are you doing, Kane!? [large]Eee[rf]k!"::
36868::$$$message_0267_0361_0000$$$::"So, Makino-G. Tell me how this makes you feel."::
36869::$$$message_0267_0362_0000$$$::"...I feel really frustrated."::
36870::$$$message_0267_0363_0000$$$::[movefg opacity=255 left=84 top=77 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]Yukika [movefg opacity=255 left=92 top=86 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]squirms [movefg opacity=255 left=113 top=71 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]in [movefg opacity=255 left=103 top=91 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]my arms. [movefg opacity=255 left=115 top=71 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]In my mind [movefg opacity=255 left=88 top=91 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]I [movefg opacity=255 left=70 top=76 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]apologize to her[movefg opacity=255 left=109 top=71 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0].[lr]::
36871::$$$message_0267_0363_0001$$$::I want [movefg opacity=255 left=92 top=88 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]to continue with [movefg opacity=255 left=65 top=71 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]the explanation, [movefg opacity=255 left=71 top=90 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]but I can't [movefg opacity=255 left=116 top=91 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]without attracting [movefg opacity=255 left=81 top=71 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]unwanted [movefg opacity=255 left=54 top=100 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0]attention[movefg opacity=255 left=106 top=71 time=100 rule=クロスフェード accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01d(中) textoff=0].[lr]::
36872::$$$message_0267_0363_0002$$$::I let Yukika go.::
36873::$$$message_0267_0364_0000$$$::"Exactly. Sorry for being weird, Yukika."::
36874::$$$message_0267_0365_0000$$$::"Y-you surprised me... [cacheimage storage=由紀香制服02c頬(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香制服02c頬(中) textoff=0]Suddenly [clfg time=200 storage=蒔寺制服01e(遠) textoff=0]hugging me like that.[cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01c(中)][wvl][fg index=2000 time=300 pos=r storage=蒔寺制服01c(中) textoff=0]"::
36875::$$$message_0267_0366_0000$$$::"...I'm not sure I totally get what you're saying, Himuro."::
36876::$$$message_0267_0367_0000$$$::"Think of it as if you're Lady Mitsuzuri, Yukika is Emiya, and I'm Lady Tohsaka."::
36877::$$$message_0267_0368_0000$$$::"At first, they were in a roughly equilateral triangle[line len=2][cacheimage storage=氷室制服01a(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服01a(近) textoff=0]no, there was a large gap between Emiya and Tohsaka, making it an isosceles triangle. There's no discord between them, at this point."::
36878::$$$message_0267_0369_0000$$$::I use my fingers to imitate the shape.[lr]::
36879::$$$message_0267_0369_0001$$$::[rep fliplr=1 storages=由紀香制服02c(近),蒔寺制服01c(近) time=300 flipudr=0 poss=l,r bg=i学園廊下 indexes=1000,2000 textoff=0]Makidera and Yukika nod along.::
36880::$$$message_0267_0370_0000$$$::"They're just friends at that point, nothing special."::
36881::$$$message_0267_0371_0000$$$::"But if she did what Kane did..."::
36882::$$$message_0267_0372_0000$$$::"Now, imagine if Lady Mitsuzuri's two friends started dating."::
36883::$$$message_0267_0373_0000$$$::"Lady Mitsuzuri, in Makidera's position, would slowly become isolated. And naturally, she'd start to feel..."[lr]::
36884::$$$message_0267_0373_0001$$$::Makidera finishes my sentence.::
36885::$$$message_0267_0374_0000$$$::"Mitsuzuri would feel frustrated. Whether she liked Emiya in that way or not, she'd feel like he was taken from her."::
36886::$$$message_0267_0375_0000$$$::"Not just frustrated, she may have begun to see Emiya as a potential love interest."::
36887::$$$message_0267_0376_0000$$$::"If so, she would become conscious of Shirou Emiya, and it would begin to color her interactions with him. Therefore..."::
36888::$$$message_0267_0377_0000$$$::I pause to let that sink in.[lr]::
36889::$$$message_0267_0377_0001$$$::Once I'm sure Makidera and Yukika are on the same page, I continue.::
36890::$$$message_0267_0378_0000$$$::"You could even say that Lady Tohsaka's relationship opened the door for Lady Mitsuzuri to date Emiya."::
36891::$$$message_0267_0379_0000$$$::"That's perfect. The most persuasive theory you've ever come up with, Himuro! That's some ice-cold logic![lr]::
36892::$$$message_0267_0379_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服02c(近) textoff=0]Someone give this woman three cushions!"::
36893::$$$message_0267_0380_0000$$$::Makidera erupts in good cheer after my explanation.[lr]::
36894::$$$message_0267_0380_0001$$$::She just implied that my theories so far have been too far-fetched...and it pains me that I can't deny it.[lr]::
36895::$$$message_0267_0380_0002$$$::Yukika's reaction is night and day to Makidera's exultation at having solved a riddle.[lr]::
36896::$$$message_0267_0380_0003$$$::It hurts to see that she isn't smiling at all.::
36897::$$$message_0267_0381_0000$$$::"But... That would mean Miss Tohsaka is..."::
36898::$$$message_0267_0382_0000$$$::"As much as it pains me to say this, it would mean that Emiya is cheating on Lady Tohsaka."::
36899::$$$message_0267_0383_0000$$$::"Or rather, that there's a love triangle between the three of them. In any case..."::
36900::$$$message_0267_0384_0000$$$::We only meant to find out who Mitsuzuri's romantic partner was, but it somehow snowballed into a love triangle.[lr]::
36901::$$$message_0267_0384_0001$$$::And, as a curious third party, I feel a sense of self-loathing.[lr]::
36902::$$$message_0267_0384_0002$$$::...However, far from being a third party, one person here acts like she's won the lottery.::
36903::$$$message_0267_0385_0000$$$::"Would ya look at that. Emiya's one heck of a player! Two-timing Tohsaka and Mitsuzuri, well done. I can respect an enemy like that."[lr]::
36904::$$$message_0267_0385_0001$$$::"That's not a nice way to talk about people, Maki."::
36905::$$$message_0267_0386_0000$$$::"...Eep. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服03b(近)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服03b(近) textoff=0]But I wonder what Tohsaka would think if she knew... [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01d(近)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01d(近) textoff=0]Hmm, hm."::
36906::$$$message_0267_0387_0000$$$::She can't stop herself from smiling, even after Yukika's reproach.[lr]::
36907::$$$message_0267_0387_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01e(近) textoff=0]Even when Ryudou was the person in question, Tohsaka's been at the center of Makidera's interest. It feels excessive compared to her usual remarks about taking advantage of Tohsaka.::
36908::$$$message_0267_0388_0000$$$::"Urgh, why do you keep looking at me like that, Himuro? It's creeping me out. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01e(近)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01e(近) textoff=0]Or could it be that you're in love with me or something? [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服04c(近)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服04c(近) textoff=0]Play with fire, and you might get burned!"::
36909::$$$message_0267_0389_0000$$$::"And you'd get frostbite if you fell for me. They say names reflect who we are, after all.[lr]::
36910::$$$message_0267_0389_0001$$$::Anyway...this is turning into a hassle."::
36911::$$$message_0267_0390_0000$$$::"Heheheh. Wouldn't it be good if Emiya and Mitsuzuri got closer now that Emiya's fighting with Tohsaka? The day of Makidera's victory isn't so far off after all!"::
36912::$$$message_0267_0391_0000$$$::"You might find it amusing, but we still don't have any concrete proof for the theory. I don't think it would be a bad idea to wait and see, but..."::
36913::$$$message_0267_0392_0000$$$::I'll avoid questioning any of them directly this time.[lr]::
36914::$$$message_0267_0392_0001$$$::It would be humiliating to inject myself into the middle of a love triangle.[lr]::
36915::$$$message_0267_0392_0002$$$::I meet Makidera's exasperated expression.::
36916::$$$message_0267_0393_0000$$$::"Are you going to ask someone about it again, Himuro?"::
36917::$$$message_0267_0394_0000$$$::"This is starting to feel like a habit after coming this far, but I think we should quit while we're ahead."::
36918::$$$message_0267_0395_0000$$$::"There isn't anyone we know who knows all three of them well. Sadly, we've hit a dead end..."::
36919::$$$message_0267_0396_0000$$$::I can't think of anyone who would fit the bill.[lr]::
36920::$$$message_0267_0396_0001$$$::But then, Yukika surprises me with a murmur.::
36921::$$$message_0267_0397_0000$$$::"No, there is...someone."[cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01g(近)][wvs][wait canskip=false time=600][chgfg time=200 storage=蒔寺制服01g(近) textoff=0]::
36922::$$$message_0267_0398_0000$$$::"...Yukika."::
36923::$$$message_0267_0399_0000$$$::"I want to be sure about Emiya. Otherwise, Miss Tohsaka will..."::
36924::$$$message_0267_0400_0000$$$::"...Yeah. We should make sure after coming this far. But Yukika..."::
36925::$$$message_0267_0401_0000$$$::Do we actually know anyone that convenient?::
36926::$$$message_0267_0402_0000$$$::"There's NO way!!!"::
36927::$$$message_0267_0403_0000$$$::Her shout echoes across all of Miyama,[lr]::
36928::$$$message_0267_0403_0001$$$::rocking my ears like the roar of a jet engine.[lr]::
36929::$$$message_0267_0403_0002$$$::It's a miracle the sonic boom doesn't knock me out.::
36930::$$$message_0267_0404_0000$$$::"[large]That's [rf]not [move time=60 path=(567,152,200)(567,152,0)(567,152,255)(567,152,0)(567,152,100)(567,152,0) accel=0 storage=002-氷室眼鏡白光 textoff=0]even funny! [wvl][wm canskip=0][se storage=se065.wav][quake vmax=20 hmax=0 time=500]Who [large]do [rf]you think lives [wvl][move time=100 path=(567,152,200)(567,152,0)(567,152,200)(567,152,0)(567,152,100)(567,152,0) accel=0 storage=002-氷室眼鏡白光 textoff=0]in that [large]house [rf]right now? [wvl][wm canskip=0][se storage=se065.wav][quake vmax=20 hmax=0 time=500]Sakura, Saber, Miss Tohsaka, and Rider are all there[large], [wvl][move time=50 path=(567,152,255)(567,152,0)(567,152,100)(567,152,0)(567,152,200)(567,152,0) accel=0 storage=002-氷室眼鏡白光 textoff=0]you know![rf][wm canskip=0]"[wvs][se storage=se065.wav][quake vmax=20 hmax=0 time=500]::
36931::$$$message_0267_0405_0000$$$::"But if we throw Miss Mitsuzuri into the fray, [wvl][move time=100 path=(567,152,200)(567,152,0)(567,152,200)(567,152,0)(567,152,100)(567,152,0) accel=0 storage=002-氷室眼鏡白光 textoff=0]you're talking about a rom-com no less than a [large]hot springs trip [rf]cliché[line len=2][wvl][wm canskip=0][se storage=se065.wav][quake vmax=20 hmax=0 time=500][quad]actually, I can't [rf]let it get any worse, as a teacher, [large]among [rf]other things!"::
36932::$$$message_0267_0406_0000$$$::It wasn't so much a voice as it was a solid mass of air, expelled at full force from her lungs.[lr]::
36933::$$$message_0267_0406_0001$$$::[move time=60 path=(567,152,200)(567,152,0)(567,152,255)(567,152,0) accel=0 storage=002-氷室眼鏡白光 textoff=0]My glasses' lenses vibrate.[wm canskip=0]::
36934::$$$message_0267_0407_0000$$$::"When Shirou comes home, Saber greets him with a picture-perfect bow, [cacheimage storage=藤06a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤06a(中) textoff=0]and Sakura, in her apron, lets her beloved Senpai know that dinner is ready."::
36935::$$$message_0267_0408_0000$$$::"Miss Tohsaka pulls him aside for something or another, [cacheimage storage=藤08c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤08c(中) textoff=0]while Rider asks if he wants to take a bath together."::
36936::$$$message_0267_0409_0000$$$::"This archetypal live-in harem situation [large]is bad [rf]enough, and yet... [cacheimage storage=藤03a(中),由紀香制服01g(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤03a(中),由紀香制服01g(中) textoff=0][large]And yet, [rf]Miss Himuro!"[wvs][move time=80 path=(567,152,200)(567,152,0)(567,152,255)(567,152,0) accel=0 storage=002-氷室眼鏡白光 textoff=0][wm canskip=0]::
36937::$$$message_0267_0410_0000$$$::"Haa..."::
36938::$$$message_0267_0411_0000$$$::"Sh-[large]sh-[rf]sh-sh-sh[large]shee[rf]eeeeeeee![cacheimage storage=由紀香制服01d(中),藤04a(中),蒔寺制服01g(中),氷室制服02e(中),o衛宮邸付近の街並(秋)-(昼)][wvl][stopquake][rep tops=75,127,30,58 fliplrs=,1,, storages=由紀香制服01d(中),藤04a(中),蒔寺制服01g(中),氷室制服02e(中) time=300 opacities=,,, lefts=387,-215,606,487 bg=o衛宮邸付近の街並(秋)-(昼) indexes=1000,2000,3000,4000,5000 textoff=0] [move time=80 path=(-239,141,255)(-219,124,255) accel=0 storage=藤04a(中) textoff=0][quad]Gehbora[wm canskip=0]ragh[move time=100 path=(-238,146,255)(-215,129,255)(-224,150,255)(-220,130,255)(-238,146,255)(-215,129,255) accel=0 storage=藤04a(中) textoff=0]![rf]"[wm canskip=0]::
36939::$$$message_0267_0412_0000$$$::"Please don't vomit ectoplasm, Ms. Fujimura. I was only asking a question.[lr]::
36940::$$$message_0267_0412_0001$$$::We just want to verify something..."::
36941::$$$message_0267_0413_0000$$$::I soothe Ms. Fujimura, who's writhing and hyperventilating.[lr]::
36942::$$$message_0267_0413_0001$$$::...Perhaps we shouldn't have asked her after all.::
36943::$$$message_0267_0414_0000$$$::"..."::
36944::$$$message_0267_0415_0000$$$::I recall the events that happened earlier.[lr]::
36945::$$$message_0267_0415_0001$$$::Yukika proposed Ms. Fujimura. That was indeed a blind spot.[lr]::
36946::$$$message_0267_0415_0002$$$::She's the faculty advisor to the kyudo club, and I've heard she's a sister figure to Shirou Emiya. She also has some association with Lady Tohsaka, it seems.[lr]::
36947::$$$message_0267_0415_0003$$$::While she's approachable, this isn't something I can ask her about at school.::
36948::$$$message_0267_0416_0000$$$::Thus, I've decided to question her after school, once she's off campus.[lr]::
36949::$$$message_0267_0416_0001$$$::At that time...::
36950::$$$message_0267_0417_0000$$$::"Ah, Miss Himuro and Miss Makidera. Miss Saegusa, too. Hello!"::
36951::$$$message_0267_0418_0000$$$::"Funny running into you out here. You all live that way, right? Are you walking home together?"::
36952::$$$message_0267_0419_0000$$$::"Huh? You want to ask me something...? [wvl canskip=false time=400]Hmm, mrgh. [cacheimage storage=藤01c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤01c(中) textoff=0]Well, I am everyone's favorite Miss Fujimura, so I'll hear you out."::
36953::$$$message_0267_0420_0000$$$::"What do you want to ask about? Studying? Friendships? Bullying is wrong, you know. [cacheimage storage=藤10a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤10a(中) textoff=0]There's nothing uglier than responding to hate with more hate."::
36954::$$$message_0267_0421_0000$$$::Okay, [clfg time=300 pos=all textoff=0]I'd better cut to the chase while she's in a good mood.::
36955::$$$message_0267_0422_0000$$$::"...Huh? Shirou?"::
36956::$$$message_0267_0423_0000$$$::"Urgh... Well, if you insist... I do know him well, yeah."::
36957::$$$message_0267_0424_0000$$$::"Miss Mitsuzuri...? Miss Tohsaka, too?"::
36958::$$$message_0267_0425_0000$$$::And then...::
36959::$$$message_0267_0426_0000$$$::"..."::
36960::$$$message_0267_0427_0000$$$::"..."::
36961::$$$message_0267_0428_0000$$$::...she became[lr]::
36962::$$$message_0267_0428_0001$$$::like this.[lr]::
36963::$$$message_0267_0428_0002$$$::I wonder if I phrased something incorrectly...::
36964::$$$message_0267_0429_0000$$$::"If you all let your guards down, Shirou could eat you up at any time!"::
36965::$$$message_0267_0430_0000$$$::"Ehhhh!?"::
36966::$$$message_0267_0431_0000$$$::"Ugh... Emiya... That guy..."::
36967::$$$message_0267_0432_0000$$$::"No, thank you."::
36968::$$$message_0267_0433_0000$$$::"Hey, don't just believe me! Shirou isn't that much of a horndog!"::
36969::$$$message_0267_0434_0000$$$::"I adopted him from Kiritsugu and took good care of him, so how could I ever make up for it if he grew up into some pervy kid!"::
36970::$$$message_0267_0435_0000$$$::Ms. Fujimura is quite flustered.[lr]::
36971::$$$message_0267_0435_0001$$$::Drat, how should we brib[line len=2]I mean, pacify her?::
36972::$$$message_0267_0436_0000$$$::"A-are you okay, ma'am?"::
36973::$$$message_0267_0437_0000$$$::"You don't look all right."::
36974::$$$message_0267_0438_0000$$$::"I-I'm totally sane! [large]They're [rf]the crazy ones! The food looks really yummy, though!"::
36975::$$$message_0267_0439_0000$$$::Her finger is pointing at the front gate of the Emiya residence.[lr]::
36976::$$$message_0267_0439_0001$$$::...I'm impressed that he lives in an estate that resembles a samurai's residence. It's no surprise that he has multiple roommates, then.[lr]::
36977::$$$message_0267_0439_0002$$$::...Wait, it's still strange that Lady Tohsaka and Lady Matou live there.[lr]::
36978::$$$message_0267_0439_0003$$$::More importantly, we can't proceed with this conversation unless we calm Ms. Fujimura down.[lr]::
36979::$$$message_0267_0439_0004$$$::I clap her on the shoulders with both hands, imagining that this is how to treat an older person in a position of respect.::
36980::$$$message_0267_0440_0000$$$::"I'm terribly sorry, Ms. Fujimura. I wasn't trying to pry into Emiya's challenging home environment. I only wanted to ask if he is dating Lady Mitsuzuri."::
36981::$$$message_0267_0441_0000$$$::"Huh? You mean they aren't already dating?"::
36982::$$$message_0267_0442_0000$$$::Did I completely misunderstand her dramatic reaction earlier?[lr]::
36983::$$$message_0267_0442_0001$$$::I suddenly feel weak at the knees...::
36984::$$$message_0267_0443_0000$$$::"They are, aren't they?"::
36985::$$$message_0267_0444_0000$$$::"Stop confusing her with your wishful thinking, Makino-G."::
36986::$$$message_0267_0445_0000$$$::"W-what do you think, Ms. Fujimura?"::
36987::$$$message_0267_0446_0000$$$::Yukika pipes up while I'm rebuking Makidera.[lr]::
36988::$$$message_0267_0446_0001$$$::She suddenly goes quiet, considering the question.::
36989::$$$message_0267_0447_0000$$$::"Hm... Now that you mention it, they are friends, but I don't think they're in a romantic relationship."::
36990::$$$message_0267_0448_0000$$$::"Well, we have proof..."::
36991::$$$message_0267_0449_0000$$$::"Really? What proof? Want me to leak it?"::
36992::$$$message_0267_0450_0000$$$::Ms. Fujimura leans toward Makidera, looking intrigued.[lr]::
36993::$$$message_0267_0450_0001$$$::...I think these two may be birds of a feather, but I need to keep this conversation on track.[lr]::
36994::$$$message_0267_0450_0002$$$::I get between them, and turn to our expectant teacher.::
36995::$$$message_0267_0451_0000$$$::"We don't have proof, exactly. After Lady Tohsaka and Emiya had an apparent falling-out, we saw Emiya having a friendly chat with Lady Mitsuzuri."::
36996::$$$message_0267_0452_0000$$$::"Isn't that proof enough? We've got circumstantial evidence."::
36997::$$$message_0267_0453_0000$$$::I deliberately ignore her grumbling.[lr]::
36998::$$$message_0267_0453_0001$$$::Ms. Fujimura thinks about the limited evidence we have.::
36999::$$$message_0267_0454_0000$$$::"Hmm... But they're both from the kyudo club, and I think Miss Mitsuzuri still sees Shirou as a rival. They don't dislike each other, though."::
37000::$$$message_0267_0455_0000$$$::"That's why we weren't positive. We thought you might be able to shed some light on it..."::
37001::$$$message_0267_0456_0000$$$::I steal a glance at Ms. Fujimura's expression.[lr]::
37002::$$$message_0267_0456_0001$$$::Earlier, she laughed bashfully when we asked her for help, but now she's harder to read.[lr]::
37003::$$$message_0267_0456_0002$$$::Her attention seems focused on some distant place, rather than us.[lr]::
37004::$$$message_0267_0456_0003$$$::From her earlier furor to her gloom now, it's hard to reconcile this with the Ms. Fujimura we know.::
37005::$$$message_0267_0457_0000$$$::"...I think Miss Mitsuzuri really isn't dating Shirou after all."::
37006::$$$message_0267_0458_0000$$$::"Huh... Why do you say that?"::
37007::$$$message_0267_0459_0000$$$::"It's my intuition as his big sister, I guess. And as a teacher, too."::
37008::$$$message_0267_0460_0000$$$::She tries to laugh it off.[lr]::
37009::$$$message_0267_0460_0001$$$::I react with neither dejection nor relief to her conclusion. I just impassively accept what's unfolding before me.::
37010::$$$message_0267_0461_0000$$$::"Right now, Miss Tohsaka and Sakura have a soft spot for Shirou, but things would be a lot worse if your theory was true."::
37011::$$$message_0267_0462_0000$$$::"Shirou's always been awkward around girls. Even now he still makes a mess of things, to be honest."::
37012::$$$message_0267_0463_0000$$$::She muses, with a mixture of nostalgia and tenderness.[lr]::
37013::$$$message_0267_0463_0001$$$::It doesn't feel right to interrupt her right now.::
37014::$$$message_0267_0464_0000$$$::"I didn't raise Shirou to be someone cunning enough to make a move on Miss Mitsuzuri despite all that. [cacheimage storage=藤08d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤08d(中) textoff=0]Ah, sorry if that makes you uncomfortable."::
37015::$$$message_0267_0465_0000$$$::"No, this is very interesting," I answer quietly.[lr]::
37016::$$$message_0267_0465_0001$$$::Ms. Fujimura's warm, lonely smile suddenly shifts, as if she just remembered something, and she sidles up to us.::
37017::$$$message_0267_0466_0000$$$::"Y'know, things were really tough when Miss Tohsaka and Shirou started dating. [cacheimage storage=由紀香制服01c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香制服01c(中) textoff=0]I had a front-row seat to the whole mess!"::
37018::$$$message_0267_0467_0000$$$::"Huh? What do you mean by tough...?"::
37019::$$$message_0267_0468_0000$$$::"Mufufufu, despite appearances, Miss Tohsaka went after Shirou really aggressively. Out of nowhere. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01g(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01g(中) textoff=0]She just showed up and announced she was moving in! That threw us for a loop!"::
37020::$$$message_0267_0469_0000$$$::"Are we talking about the same Tohsaka? [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服04b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服04b(中) textoff=0]...That doesn't sound like her. Maybe Emiya's got some dirt on her."::
37021::$$$message_0267_0470_0000$$$::I think I can hear Makidera gnashing her teeth.::
37022::$$$message_0267_0471_0000$$$::...I'm very interested in hearing how Emiya and Lady Tohsaka grew closer. They never seemed to have much to do with each other before they started going out.[lr]::
37023::$$$message_0267_0471_0001$$$::Yukika blushes as the conversation becomes more candid.[lr]::
37024::$$$message_0267_0471_0002$$$::I'm not sure whether I want to talk about Lady Mitsuzuri or Lady Tohsaka anymore.::
37025::$$$message_0267_0472_0000$$$::"And what did Emiya do? He's still a boy. Did he creep into her room at night?"::
37026::$$$message_0267_0473_0000$$$::"No, but they apparently did go out on dates at night."::
37027::$$$message_0267_0474_0000$$$::"That's back when Saber first showed up. Oh, but then I collapsed and went to the hospital, and when I came home, they already..."::
37028::$$$message_0267_0475_0000$$$::"A-already? Already what, Ms. Fujimura!?"::
37029::$$$message_0267_0476_0000$$$::Ms. Fujimura lets out a sly, cat-like laugh.[lr]::
37030::$$$message_0267_0476_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02b(中) textoff=0]...Now I'm not even sure how to steer this back on topic.::
37031::$$$message_0267_0477_0000$$$::"Well, Shirou's so oblivious that you have to pounce on him hard or he won't even notice. Sakura's just as aggressive, and despite how Saber seems, she can be pretty intense when it comes to it..."::
37032::$$$message_0267_0478_0000$$$::"What did I do to Shirou,[cacheimage storage=氷室制服02a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02a(中) textoff=0] Taiga?"::
37033::$$$message_0267_0479_0000$$$::...Who's that?[lr]::
37034::$$$message_0267_0479_0001$$$::A pretty voice rings high and clear, like a silver bell.[lr]::
37035::$$$message_0267_0479_0002$$$::It's heavenly and beautiful, but oddly, doesn't sound suited to singing.[lr]::
37036::$$$message_0267_0479_0003$$$::Still, it seems to resonate with my very bones...[playstop time=4000 nowait=1]::
37037::$$$message_0267_0480_0000$$$::"Huh?"::
37038::$$$message_0267_0481_0000$$$::"Welcome back, Taiga. And a pleasure to meet the rest of you, I believe."::
37039::$$$message_0267_0482_0000$$$::I turn to see a blonde girl standing there.[lr]::
37040::$$$message_0267_0482_0001$$$::She's so charming that, for a moment, I forget to blink.[lr]::
37041::$$$message_0267_0482_0002$$$::I can't comprehend what such a beautiful girl is doing here.[lr]::
37042::$$$message_0267_0482_0003$$$::I'm at a loss as to how to respond to her composed expression.::
37043::$$$message_0267_0483_0000$$$::"H-hello. It's nice to meet you. My name is Yukika Saegusa."::
37044::$$$message_0267_0484_0000$$$::"..."[wm canskip=0]::
37045::$$$message_0267_0485_0000$$$::"Oh, Saber. What are you doing here?"::
37046::$$$message_0267_0486_0000$$$::"I was about to leave, when I heard a commotion that sounded like you. I could hear you from inside the house."::
37047::$$$message_0267_0487_0000$$$::"...I know how valiantly you struggle in your daily life, but we should try to avoid disturbing the neighbors."::
37048::$$$message_0267_0488_0000$$$::Her speech is polite yet lofty.[lr]::
37049::$$$message_0267_0488_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服13a(中) textoff=0]From Ms. Fujimura's reaction, it stands to reason that this is Saber, one of the names I've heard Ryudou and Tohsaka bring up.::
37050::$$$message_0267_0489_0000$$$::I...suppose it wouldn't be such an odd name for a foreigner. Maybe. [chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服13c(中) textoff=0]I wonder what its etymology is.::
37051::$$$message_0267_0490_0000$$$::However...[lr]::
37052::$$$message_0267_0490_0001$$$::I consider myself as baselessly confident as any other person, but somehow, I feel daunted in front of her.::
37053::$$$message_0267_0491_0000$$$::"Ah-ha-ha! No worries, we're all neighbors here."::
37054::$$$message_0267_0492_0000$$$::"Yes, that may always have been true for you, Taiga...[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服06a腕B(中)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服06a腕B(中) textoff=0] May I ask if these are Shirou's guests?"[cacheimage storage=藤01a(中)][wvs][chgfg time=300 storage=藤01a(中) textoff=0]::
37055::$$$message_0267_0493_0000$$$::She's looking at us now.[lr]::
37056::$$$message_0267_0493_0001$$$::While she doesn't seem on edge, her demeanor seems to interrogate each one of us. It's a little intimidating. She also gives off a gravity that goes beyond her beauty.::
37057::$$$message_0267_0494_0000$$$::Makidera seems to be avoiding Saber, perhaps out of some sort of instinctual fear.[lr]::
37058::$$$message_0267_0494_0001$$$::Only Yukika takes it in stride and speaks to Lady Saber properly.::
37059::$$$message_0267_0495_0000$$$::"Um... We're third-year students at Homurahara."::
37060::$$$message_0267_0496_0000$$$::"I see. You're Shirou's schoolmates. I am... You can call me Saber. What about your two companions?"::
37061::$$$message_0267_0497_0000$$$::"Kane Himuro and Kaede Makidera. You've heard Miss Makidera's name before, right?"::
37062::$$$message_0267_0498_0000$$$::We bow as Ms. Fujimura introduces us. Lady Saber seems to mull the names over, as if to commit them to memory.::
37063::$$$message_0267_0499_0000$$$::"I've heard Rin mention her name. Kaede, correct?"::
37064::$$$message_0267_0500_0000$$$::"Uh...um, ahahaha. Tohsaka and I are friends, yeah, aha..."::
37065::$$$message_0267_0501_0000$$$::Overwhelmed, Makidera answers haltingly.[lr]::
37066::$$$message_0267_0501_0001$$$::Normally, she'd be happy to be associated with Lady Tohsaka.::
37067::$$$message_0267_0502_0000$$$::"A pleasure to meet you, Kane. I can tell you're a capable person.[lr]::
37068::$$$message_0267_0502_0001$$$::I'm honored to make your acquaintance as well, Yukika."::
37069::$$$message_0267_0503_0000$$$::"No...it's no big deal, really..."::
37070::$$$message_0267_0504_0000$$$::"...It's nice to meet you."::
37071::$$$message_0267_0505_0000$$$::Once again, my thoughts are jumbled.[lr]::
37072::$$$message_0267_0505_0001$$$::I knew Lady Saber by name, but I had no idea she was so beautiful.[lr]::
37073::$$$message_0267_0505_0002$$$::That aligns with Ryudou's praise of her... Now, how does her existence affect the questions I've been grappling with?::
37074::$$$message_0267_0506_0000$$$::She's connected to all of this, somehow.[lr]::
37075::$$$message_0267_0506_0001$$$::An awkward silence passes after our introductions.[lr]::
37076::$$$message_0267_0506_0002$$$::The sound of a snap of fingers breaks the tension.::
37077::$$$message_0267_0507_0000$$$::"Sakura and Rider are both here, right? Let's go inside and have some tea."::
37078::$$$message_0267_0508_0000$$$::"Yes. I'm sorry, Taiga, but I was just on the way out."::
37079::$$$message_0267_0509_0000$$$::"Oh, too bad... [cacheimage storage=藤08e(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤08e(中) textoff=0]And here I was hoping we could share some embarrassing stories about Shirou while it's just us girls here."::
37080::$$$message_0267_0510_0000$$$::Ms. Fujimura nods in disappointment, arms folded.[lr]::
37081::$$$message_0267_0510_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服07a(中) textoff=0]Lady Saber seems reluctant to leave as well, but she smiles resignedly.[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服01b(中) textoff=0]::
37082::$$$message_0267_0511_0000$$$::"Ayako asked for me... Shirou is with her, I think."::
37083::$$$message_0267_0512_0000$$$::"Oh. It must be important if Ayako's asking for you. Are you going to see them now?[lr]::
37084::$$$message_0267_0512_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=藤02a腕B(中) textoff=0]Let us know if you can't make it back in time for dinner."::
37085::$$$message_0267_0513_0000$$$::"All right, then, I'll take my leave."::
37086::$$$message_0267_0514_0000$$$::She just mentioned Ayako Mitsuzuri's name.[lr]::
37087::$$$message_0267_0514_0001$$$::The sight of her bowing and leaving takes my breath away. Her figure looks just as graceful from behind.::
37088::$$$message_0267_0515_0000$$$::Wait, it can't be...surely that's impossible, but if it were, then it truly would be... It's as if the autumn breeze were sweeping her path clean.::
37089::$$$message_0267_0516_0000$$$::"Ah... She's gone..."::
37090::$$$message_0267_0517_0000$$$::"Whew... That scared me. Who knew a girl as pretty as a model lived here..."::
37091::$$$message_0267_0518_0000$$$::"Ufufufu. Saber is as pretty as a doll, but she's amazingly strong."::
37092::$$$message_0267_0519_0000$$$::"She's one of Kiritsugu's relatives. I wonder who trained her."::
37093::$$$message_0267_0520_0000$$$::Ms. Fujimura fondly talks about Lady Saber as if they're family. If the Fuyuki Tiger says she's strong, then she must be talking about some form of martial arts.::
37094::$$$message_0267_0521_0000$$$::"No way! That thin little girl?"::
37095::$$$message_0267_0522_0000$$$::"Don't judge a book by its cover. Her small frame is more than it seems. All masters are like that, actually."::
37096::$$$message_0267_0523_0000$$$::"I've never managed to score a single hit on Saber. Age isn't kind... [cacheimage storage=藤08d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤08d(中) textoff=0]Oh no, I sound like an old man."::
37097::$$$message_0267_0524_0000$$$::"Huh... Miss Saber sounds incredible..."::
37098::$$$message_0267_0525_0000$$$::If she's that skilled, one can hardly be blamed for being infatuated with her.[lr]::
37099::$$$message_0267_0525_0001$$$::Setting Shinji's false bravado aside, Ryudou and Emiya are both said to be skilled martial artists.[lr]::
37100::$$$message_0267_0525_0002$$$::Yet Lady Saber is a cut above, and adorably lovely to boot...::
37101::$$$message_0267_0526_0000$$$::"What's up, Himuro?[cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服04a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服04a(中) textoff=0] You fall for Miss Saber, or something?"::
37102::$$$message_0267_0527_0000$$$::"No. Mitsuzuri did."::
37103::$$$message_0267_0528_0000$$$::That would explain this arrangement.[lr]::
37104::$$$message_0267_0528_0001$$$::In fact, this is a much more desirable situation than the confusing love triangle.[lr]::
37105::$$$message_0267_0528_0002$$$::There's no problem at... Actually, there's nothing [font italic=true]but[font italic=false] problems now.::
37106::$$$message_0267_0529_0000$$$::"Huh?"[rf][lr]::
37107::$$$message_0267_0529_0001$$$::"...Kane?"::
37108::$$$message_0267_0530_0000$$$::"I seem to have made a serious error. I just assumed that Lady Mitsuzuri had a [font italic=true]boyfriend[font italic=false]."::
37109::$$$message_0267_0531_0000$$$::"That mistaken assumption threw off all of our deductions and is the reason we've been on a wild-goose chase."::
37110::$$$message_0267_0532_0000$$$::I feel vexed, even as I try to persuade myself.[lr]::
37111::$$$message_0267_0532_0001$$$::A part of me feels the urge to finish explaining.::
37112::$$$message_0267_0533_0000$$$::"Ayako Mitsuzuri isn't in love with a male...but a female."::
37113::$$$message_0267_0534_0000$$$::"Uh... Himuro, are you trying to say that Mitsuzuri is..."::
37114::$$$message_0267_0535_0000$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 left=150 top=71 time=200 accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01g(中) textoff=0]Woah, [cacheimage storage=由紀香制服01g(中)][wvl][wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=255 left=51 top=71 time=180 accel=0 storage=由紀香制服01g(中) textoff=0]woah, [wvl][wm canskip=0][move time=250 path=(129,71,255)(87,71,255) accel=-1 storage=由紀香制服01g(中) textoff=0]woah!"[wm canskip=0]::
37115::$$$message_0267_0536_0000$$$::"Don't be silly. Mitsuzuri's dating Emiya."::
37116::$$$message_0267_0537_0000$$$::"I thought I told you to cut it out with the wishful thinking."::
37117::$$$message_0267_0538_0000$$$::"It's true they're close, but Ms. Fujimura's testimony indicates it's unlikely their relationship will develop any further."::
37118::$$$message_0267_0539_0000$$$::I seem to have made my point strongly enough that Makidera doesn't argue back.[lr]::
37119::$$$message_0267_0539_0001$$$::In that moment, I press on further with my explanation.::
37120::$$$message_0267_0540_0000$$$::"It's precisely because Emiya and Lady Mitsuzuri are friends that it's possible for Lady Mitsuzuri to be involved with Lady Saber. Emiya was just the bridge to make it happen, whether he knows it or not."::
37121::$$$message_0267_0541_0000$$$::"The timeline fits, too. Lady Saber probably arrived about two months ago. Mitsuzuri started to act different in April. There's somewhat of a gap, but it makes sense when you consider that only one of them is a Homurahara student."::
37122::$$$message_0267_0542_0000$$$::As I continue speaking, I start to realize she's not even an exchange student.::
37123::$$$message_0267_0543_0000$$$::"Hold up, Himuro. I don't think so. Mitsuzuri and Miss Saber are both girls."::
37124::$$$message_0267_0544_0000$$$::"Love isn't limited to members of the opposite sex."::
37125::$$$message_0267_0545_0000$$$::"Lady Mitsuzuri believes that it's important for a beautiful person to be skilled with both pen and sword. Meanwhile, Lady Saber is a gorgeous master martial artist who gives even the Tiger of Fuyuki pause."::
37126::$$$message_0267_0546_0000$$$::"It isn't hard to imagine that Mitsuzuri's ideals turned into yearning, and eventually attachment."::
37127::$$$message_0267_0547_0000$$$::"Speaking of which, Miss Mitsuzuri did challenge Saber to sparring matches."[lr]::
37128::$$$message_0267_0547_0001$$$::Ms. Fujimura reveals an important piece of evidence.::
37129::$$$message_0267_0548_0000$$$::"Is that true, Ms. Fujimura?"::
37130::$$$message_0267_0549_0000$$$::"Yeah. I've seen it a few times. Of course, Miss Mitsuzuri didn't stand a chance, but she looked so happy about it I got a little jealous."::
37131::$$$message_0267_0550_0000$$$::"Ah, the springtime of youth," she muses.::
37132::$$$message_0267_0551_0000$$$::"Hm... Are we sure about this? It doesn't really seem to fit for me. Girls get close all the time."::
37133::$$$message_0267_0552_0000$$$::"And I'm saying this is an extreme form of that."::
37134::$$$message_0267_0553_0000$$$::"Besides, the love triangle between Lady Mitsuzuri, Emiya, and Lady Tohsaka was already a dubious theory. If Lady Mitsuzuri was into Lady Saber all along, then there's no issue involving Emiya."::
37135::$$$message_0267_0554_0000$$$::"Hmm... I'm not sure if it's plausible or not. And is that really okay? It feels kinda impure. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服04b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服04b(中) textoff=0]Nope, I'm not buying it. I don't think it's that type of love."::
37136::$$$message_0267_0555_0000$$$::Makidera hems and haws.[lr]::
37137::$$$message_0267_0555_0001$$$::She's being even more stubborn than usual, like there's a part of this she personally can't accept.::
37138::$$$message_0267_0556_0000$$$::"Makino-G. Does the possibility of Lady Mitsuzuri and Lady Saber having a relationship cost you in some way?"::
37139::$$$message_0267_0557_0000$$$::"Huh? Not at all. It just...doesn't make sense to me."::
37140::$$$message_0267_0558_0000$$$::I wonder what Makidera is hesitating to say.[lr]::
37141::$$$message_0267_0558_0001$$$::It's true that society at large isn't fully accepting of such relationships.::
37142::$$$message_0267_0559_0000$$$::"They do have a thorny path ahead of them.[lr]::
37143::$$$message_0267_0559_0001$$$::But I don't think there's anything wrong with supporting their feelings that have progressed past friendship."::
37144::$$$message_0267_0560_0000$$$::"Nah, that is wrong."::
37145::$$$message_0267_0561_0000$$$::"Miss Mitsuzuri and Saber, eh...? [cacheimage storage=氷室制服02a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02a(中) textoff=0]It's true that Miss Mitsuzuri is good at looking after people, and Saber's a little sloppy, so they would suit each other as a couple."::
37146::$$$message_0267_0562_0000$$$::"What? You're okay with this, Ms. Fujimura?"::
37147::$$$message_0267_0563_0000$$$::Our teacher lets out a hearty laugh.[lr]::
37148::$$$message_0267_0563_0001$$$::She doesn't seem to have a problem with same-sex relationships among her students. If anything, she's taking it rather in stride.::
37149::$$$message_0267_0564_0000$$$::"There's one last important factor, Makino-G."::
37150::$$$message_0267_0565_0000$$$::"[line len=6][cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01b(中)][wvl canskip=false time=500][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01b(中) textoff=0]You mean..."::
37151::$$$message_0267_0566_0000$$$::"...Those two would make a picture-perfect pair."::
37152::$$$message_0267_0567_0000$$$::I declare a fact.[lr]::
37153::$$$message_0267_0567_0001$$$::   Makidera looks stunned.[lr]::
37154::$$$message_0267_0567_0002$$$::Ayako Mitsuzuri has an androgynous sort of beauty, while Saber is beautiful yet resolute.::
37155::$$$message_0267_0568_0000$$$::If they both became models, I have no doubt that they would capture the hearts of artists the world over. They already have mine firmly in hand.[lr]::
37156::$$$message_0267_0568_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02d(近) textoff=0]But then, I realize something's off.::
37157::$$$message_0267_0569_0000$$$::"[large]That [font italic=true]again[font italic=false]!?[rf][lr]::
37158::$$$message_0267_0569_0001$$$::I'm confiscating all of your seat cushions, Himuro!"[stopquake]::
37159::$$$message_0267_0570_0000$$$::"Say what you want, but my artistic taste won't be swayed by losing a cushion or two[cacheimage storage=氷室制服01d(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服01d(近) textoff=0][line len=3]But..."::
37160::$$$message_0267_0571_0000$$$::Something's missing.[lr]::
37161::$$$message_0267_0571_0001$$$::Someone who's always with us while Makidera and I are going at it.[lr]::
37162::$$$message_0267_0571_0002$$$::I didn't notice right away because Ms. Fujimura is here to round out the head count.::
37163::$$$message_0267_0572_0000$$$::"A question, Makino-G."::
37164::$$$message_0267_0573_0000$$$::"What? Any last words?"::
37165::$$$message_0267_0574_0000$$$::"Where's Yukika?"::
37166::$$$message_0267_0575_0000$$$::   I look around, but Ms. Fujimura's the only other person here.[lr]::
37167::$$$message_0267_0575_0001$$$::Yukika's perennially warm smile is missing.::
37168::$$$message_0267_0576_0000$$$::"Hm? Miss Saegusa? I think she followed Saber."::
37169::$$$message_0267_0577_0000$$$::"Wha... Yukicchi did?"::
37170::$$$message_0267_0578_0000$$$::Yukika went with Lady Saber?[lr]::
37171::$$$message_0267_0578_0001$$$::Did she go to personally verify what I was saying?::
37172::$$$message_0267_0579_0000$$$::"Hey, Himuro. After her!"::
37173::$$$message_0267_0580_0000$$$::"I know. But why..."::
37174::$$$message_0267_0581_0000$$$::Was Yukika trying to be helpful in her own way?[lr]::
37175::$$$message_0267_0581_0001$$$::She was the most dejected when I proposed the love triangle around Emiya. Is she trying to smooth this over with Lady Saber...?::
37176::$$$message_0267_0582_0000$$$::"Oh, she went down towards the crossroads."::
37177::$$$message_0267_0583_0000$$$::"Understood. Thank you, Ms. Fujimura!"::
37178::$$$message_0267_0584_0000$$$::Makidera starts running.[lr]::
37179::$$$message_0267_0584_0001$$$::I'm not sure how much of a lead Yukika has on us, but Makidera and I are fast enough to easily catch up.[lr]::
37180::$$$message_0267_0584_0002$$$::Makidera speaks while we run side by side.::
37181::$$$message_0267_0585_0000$$$::"Rgh... What's Yukicchi thinking?"::
37182::$$$message_0267_0586_0000$$$::"We might have gone too far. We'd better put a stop to this before Yukika gets in too much trouble."::
37183::$$$message_0267_0587_0000$$$::The landscape passes by.[lr]::
37184::$$$message_0267_0587_0001$$$::We should have caught up to her by now. [rep storages=セイバー私服01a(遠),由紀香制服02a(遠) time=400 rule=シャッター左から poss=l,c indexes=1000,2000 textoff=0]Look, there's two people walking...[lr]::
37185::$$$message_0267_0587_0002$$$::But Makidera stops me before we catch up to them.::
37186::$$$message_0267_0588_0000$$$::"Wait, Himuro. Let's keep our distance."::
37187::$$$message_0267_0589_0000$$$::"...Roger that."[lr]::
37188::$$$message_0267_0589_0001$$$::Lady Saber and Yukika are talking.[lr]::
37189::$$$message_0267_0589_0002$$$::We watch their amicable conversation from behind. It might be better to let Yukika talk than to butt in now.::
37190::$$$message_0267_0590_0000$$$::"I see. So you're Rin's classmate? I remember now. She mentioned your name yesterday."::
37191::$$$message_0267_0591_0000$$$::"Oh... Really? Um, what was she talking about...?"::
37192::$$$message_0267_0592_0000$$$::Yukika smiles happily.[lr]::
37193::$$$message_0267_0592_0001$$$::Lady Saber smiles faintly as well, but I would liken it to a spring trickling down some rocks.[lr]::
37194::$$$message_0267_0592_0002$$$::Ahhh... If such a beauty smiled in my direction, I don't think I could take it.::
37195::$$$message_0267_0593_0000$$$::"She said you shared your lunch with her, and that it was delicious."::
37196::$$$message_0267_0594_0000$$$::"Wow... Oh, I see. [cacheimage storage=由紀香制服01f(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香制服01f(遠) textoff=0]I'm glad she liked it."::
37197::$$$message_0267_0595_0000$$$::"Rin is as much of a gourmand as you'd expect, so I think you should wear the compliment with pride."::
37198::$$$message_0267_0596_0000$$$::"Really, Tohsaka...?"[lr]::
37199::$$$message_0267_0596_0001$$$::"She doesn't feel any guilt about her lifestyle, I see."::
37200::$$$message_0267_0597_0000$$$::We whisper to each other as we follow them.[lr]::
37201::$$$message_0267_0597_0001$$$::Lady Saber did glance in our direction once, [chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服01b(遠) textoff=0]but she immediately returned her attention to Yukika.::
37202::$$$message_0267_0598_0000$$$::"Shirou was impressed when he heard it, too. [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服06a腕B(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服06a腕B(遠) textoff=0]He said he wanted to hear more about your cooking next time."::
37203::$$$message_0267_0599_0000$$$::"Ah... Emiya cooks, right? I've heard that before."::
37204::$$$message_0267_0600_0000$$$::"Yes. Lately, Sakura and Rin have been using the kitchen, but it is actually Shirou's domain."::
37205::$$$message_0267_0601_0000$$$::"I think he would look good standing in the kitchen."::
37206::$$$message_0267_0602_0000$$$::I imagine Shirou Emiya wearing an apron in the kitchen.[lr]::
37207::$$$message_0267_0602_0001$$$::It's strange how well it would suit him. The image of him covered in grease after manual labor, or spattered with cooking oil in the kitchen [chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02d(近) textoff=0]is far easier to imagine than the self-proclaimed black panther next to me.::
37208::$$$message_0267_0603_0000$$$::"Kane. Why are you looking at me like that?"::
37209::$$$message_0267_0604_0000$$$::"I was just thinking it would be hard to imagine you in the kitchen. Don't worry, I won't say I'm any good at it either."::
37210::$$$message_0267_0605_0000$$$::"Heh. You need new glasses, Himuro. I'm actually quite good at making Japanese food."::
37211::$$$message_0267_0606_0000$$$::Well, that is a surprise. Does Maki make her own lunches?[lr]::
37212::$$$message_0267_0606_0001$$$::I'm getting distracted.::
37213::$$$message_0267_0607_0000$$$::"Um, Miss Saber... Miss Mitsuzuri asked you to meet her, right?"::
37214::$$$message_0267_0608_0000$$$::"...Yes. I was asked to come to Shinto. I don't know what for, but fortunately I happen to be idle."::
37215::$$$message_0267_0609_0000$$$::"Does this happen often?"::
37216::$$$message_0267_0610_0000$$$::Yukika boldly asks Lady Saber several questions.[lr]::
37217::$$$message_0267_0610_0001$$$::Perhaps due to her nature, she speaks gently, which puts others at ease and lowers their guard.::
37218::$$$message_0267_0611_0000$$$::"I wouldn't say it's often, but it has happened before."::
37219::$$$message_0267_0612_0000$$$::"Then... Um, what do you think of her?"::
37220::$$$message_0267_0613_0000$$$::We hold our breath at the unexpected question.[lr]::
37221::$$$message_0267_0613_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服04e(遠) textoff=0]The conversation pauses. Lady Saber seems to be searching for the right words.::
37222::$$$message_0267_0614_0000$$$::"...Well, I think she's a sincere person. She's a good friend of Shirou and Rin."::
37223::$$$message_0267_0615_0000$$$::"I admire Miss Mitsuzuri, too. It would be wonderful to be like her someday."::
37224::$$$message_0267_0616_0000$$$::"Yes. I think it's uncommon to make a friend like Ayako."::
37225::$$$message_0267_0617_0000$$$::Her words are just too pure.[lr]::
37226::$$$message_0267_0617_0001$$$::Her answer is completely devoid of any undertones, like tasting distilled water.[lr]::
37227::$$$message_0267_0617_0002$$$::Her smile is so vibrant, it's almost blinding.[lr]::
37228::$$$message_0267_0617_0003$$$::She just means it as a gesture of goodwill, but I can't feel anything else from it.::
37229::$$$message_0267_0618_0000$$$::"Hey."::
37230::$$$message_0267_0619_0000$$$::Makidera pokes me in the side, whispering.[lr]::
37231::$$$message_0267_0619_0001$$$::I wonder if she senses what I do.::
37232::$$$message_0267_0620_0000$$$::"...I really don't think she and Mitsuzuri are a thing."::
37233::$$$message_0267_0621_0000$$$::"So you think so too... Well, there's still a possibility of unrequited feelings, but it seems unlikely."::
37234::$$$message_0267_0622_0000$$$::"Life's running out on your hypothesis, Himuro. I don't think it's even got an hour left."::
37235::$$$message_0267_0623_0000$$$::There's not much I can say to that.[lr]::
37236::$$$message_0267_0623_0001$$$::Well, now we're at a complete stalemate. At this point, Mitsuzuri-Tohsaka is as valid a theory as any. Only a complete dark horse could solve this now.[lr]::
37237::$$$message_0267_0623_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室制服02a(近) textoff=0]If anything, maybe she isn't with anyone...::
37238::$$$message_0267_0624_0000$$$::"What are you doing after this, Yukika?"::
37239::$$$message_0267_0625_0000$$$::"Uh... I'm sorry for making you talk with me when you already have plans..."::
37240::$$$message_0267_0626_0000$$$::"Please don't be. I enjoyed this. [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服05c(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服05c(遠) textoff=0]I know. Perhaps you could let me try your cooking sometime, along with Rin and Shirou."::
37241::$$$message_0267_0627_0000$$$::"I'll do my best! Please let me know if there's anything you'd like to eat."::
37242::$$$message_0267_0628_0000$$$::Ahh... Yukika's smile is so nice.::
37243::$$$message_0267_0629_0000$$$::"..."::
37244::$$$message_0267_0630_0000$$$::What is going on...[lr]::
37245::$$$message_0267_0630_0001$$$::By the time I realized, I'd been thrown into a side alley.::
37246::$$$message_0267_0631_0000$$$::"Wha!?"::
37247::$$$message_0267_0632_0000$$$::"Shh, shh, quiet! They're coming!"::
37248::$$$message_0267_0633_0000$$$::What on earth is going on?[lr]::
37249::$$$message_0267_0633_0001$$$::Makidera pushes me down and sticks to the corner of the wall.::
37250::$$$message_0267_0634_0000$$$::"Oh, if it isn't Saber. And Miss Saegusa, too."::
37251::$$$message_0267_0635_0000$$$::"Ah... Hello, Miss Tohsaka."::
37252::$$$message_0267_0636_0000$$$::"Welcome back, Rin."::
37253::$$$message_0267_0637_0000$$$::Is Lady Tohsaka here?[lr]::
37254::$$$message_0267_0637_0001$$$::I can tell by their voices. Lady Saber's voice is calm, while Yukika sounds surprised.[lr]::
37255::$$$message_0267_0637_0002$$$::And Makidera is panicking in a suspicious manner.::
37256::$$$message_0267_0638_0000$$$::"What an unusual duo. Are you two friends?"::
37257::$$$message_0267_0639_0000$$$::"No, we just met earlier. Are you on the way home, Rin?"::
37258::$$$message_0267_0640_0000$$$::"And you're going out, Saber?"::
37259::$$$message_0267_0641_0000$$$::Lady Tohsaka's speech sounds rather informal.[lr]::
37260::$$$message_0267_0641_0001$$$::So this is how the school's perfect honors student behaves when she is speaking normally.::
37261::$$$message_0267_0642_0000$$$::"...Maki. Is Lady Tohsaka there?"::
37262::$$$message_0267_0643_0000$$$::"..."::
37263::$$$message_0267_0644_0000$$$::She doesn't answer.[lr]::
37264::$$$message_0267_0644_0001$$$::I'll just have to get next to her and watch, too...[lr]::
37265::$$$message_0267_0644_0002$$$::Lady Tohsaka's looking as graceful as always, with Yukika acting embarrassed in front of her.::
37266::$$$message_0267_0645_0000$$$::"Yes, I'm going with Ayako to Shinto. Yukika is accompanying me, that's all."::
37267::$$$message_0267_0646_0000$$$::"...I, um, I don't have any business with Miss Mitsuzuri. I was just having a chat with Saber on the way."::
37268::$$$message_0267_0647_0000$$$::"Uh-huh... [cacheimage storage=凛私服03b(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服03b(遠) textoff=0]Hey Saber, can I borrow you for a second?"::
37269::$$$message_0267_0648_0000$$$::A scheming smile crosses [chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服05c(遠) textoff=0]Lady Tohsaka's face.[lr]::
37270::$$$message_0267_0648_0001$$$::And I think she glanced this way...[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服03a(遠) textoff=0] Did she notice us here? I suppose she might've, by now.::
37271::$$$message_0267_0649_0000$$$::"No, um, I said I'm on the way to Shinto."::
37272::$$$message_0267_0650_0000$$$::"Oh, come on. I'm going that way, too."::
37273::$$$message_0267_0651_0000$$$::"Ah, I'll leave now, then. Goodbye, Miss Saber, Miss Tohsaka."::
37274::$$$message_0267_0652_0000$$$::Sensing something amiss, Yukika bows and tries to leave.[lr]::
37275::$$$message_0267_0652_0001$$$::Even I'd find it hard to stay in that genial atmosphere with Ladies Tohsaka and Saber.[lr]::
37276::$$$message_0267_0652_0002$$$::But then, Tohsaka chuckles and looks at Yukika.::
37277::$$$message_0267_0653_0000$$$::"Miss Saegusa, would you like to join us?"::
37278::$$$message_0267_0654_0000$$$::"Wuh?"[rf]::
37279::$$$message_0267_0655_0000$$$::Someone gulps. It's Makidera, not Yukika.[lr]::
37280::$$$message_0267_0655_0001$$$::Did Lady Tohsaka just casually invite Yukika along as a friend? I can't get a read on her intentions.[lr]::
37281::$$$message_0267_0655_0002$$$::I'm also curious why she's being so pushy with Saber.::
37282::$$$message_0267_0656_0000$$$::"[large]Huh? [rf]Um, [large]Y-[rf]you want [font italic=true]me[font italic=false] to join you?"::
37283::$$$message_0267_0657_0000$$$::"Sure. You treated me to lunch, so please let me return the favor."::
37284::$$$message_0267_0658_0000$$$::"While I'm returning your lunchbox, I was thinking of offering you my lunch next time."::
37285::$$$message_0267_0659_0000$$$::"Really!?"::
37286::$$$message_0267_0660_0000$$$::Lady Tohsaka's invitation is truly flawless.[lr]::
37287::$$$message_0267_0660_0001$$$::Lady Saber looks surprised. She's surely noticed by now that Lady Tohsaka is behaving strangely, going as far as to pressure Yukika into coming along.::
37288::$$$message_0267_0661_0000$$$::"Rin...are you sure? I still have an appointment to keep with Ayako."::
37289::$$$message_0267_0662_0000$$$::"You want to talk with Miss Saegusa, right? You see, Ayako and Shirou and I..."::
37290::$$$message_0267_0663_0000$$$::"Look, I need to talk to them too, and I'll treat you to a meal, so just come with me. [cacheimage storage=凛私服04c(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服04c(遠) textoff=0]Why don't we hang out at Saint-Brieuc?"::
37291::$$$message_0267_0664_0000$$$::"Okay, ah, but I..."::
37292::$$$message_0267_0665_0000$$$::Lady Tohsaka's laugh sounds forced, somehow.[lr]::
37293::$$$message_0267_0665_0001$$$::[clfg time=400 rule=シャッター左から pos=all]She half-drags Lady Saber away.[lr]::
37294::$$$message_0267_0665_0002$$$::Yukika follows them, as if drawn in by a magnet. The bus stop to Shinto is ahead of them.::
37295::$$$message_0267_0666_0000$$$::"Hey, they're going to take Yukika with them."::
37296::$$$message_0267_0667_0000$$$::"That would be a problem. But how should we handle this? Lady Tohsaka's acting a bit odd."::
37297::$$$message_0267_0668_0000$$$::Still, I feel awkward interrupting them.[lr]::
37298::$$$message_0267_0668_0001$$$::It would be one thing if Yukika didn't want to go, but she was happy to accept. We'd just be getting in the way.[lr]::
37299::$$$message_0267_0668_0002$$$::Whether it's good or bad timing, the bus arrives.::
37300::$$$message_0267_0669_0000$$$::"Tch. What's she up to?"::
37301::$$$message_0267_0670_0000$$$::Makidera starts running.[lr]::
37302::$$$message_0267_0670_0001$$$::She runs up to the bus as the door's about to close, [se storage=se058.wav]and wedges herself into it.::
37303::$$$message_0267_0671_0000$$$::"That's going a little far, Makino-G."::
37304::$$$message_0267_0672_0000$$$::Doing something like that is just going to cause a traffic disturbance.[lr]::
37305::$$$message_0267_0672_0001$$$::I wonder how the others are reacting to the sudden bus-jacking.[sestop time=3000 storage=se570.wav nowait=1][se storage=se059.wav][lr]::
37306::$$$message_0267_0672_0002$$$::...I watch in astonishment as the bus leaves.::
37307::$$$message_0267_0673_0000$$$::"...Hm."::
37308::$$$message_0267_0674_0000$$$::Now I'm all alone.[lr]::
37309::$$$message_0267_0674_0001$$$::...Should I have gone with Makidera? But I'd feel pathetic if I got on the bus in the same manner.[lr]::
37310::$$$message_0267_0674_0002$$$::I can imagine her yelling, "Stop spacing out! Seat cushion revoked!" right about now.::
37311::$$$message_0267_0675_0000$$$::"Good grief.":Ȱ